<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">2 Samuela</book>
  <para style="h">2 Samuela</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Samuela</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samuela</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Samuela</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saula a thih hnuin Davida chuan Amalek-ho a va hneh a, a lo haw a, Ziklag khuaah ni hnih a châwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ni thum ni chuan mi pakhat, Saula riahhmun aṭangin a lo kal a, a kawrte a thlêr vek a, a lu-ah lei a kai luam a. Davida hnên a lo thlen chuan leia bawkkhupin chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Khawi aṭanga lo kal nge i nih?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Israel-te riahhmun aṭangin ka lo tlân chhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Eng thil nge lo thleng ta le, min hrilh teh,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Indonaah mite chu an tlânchhia a, mi tam tak an that a; Saula leh a fapa Jonathana pawh an thi asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Davida chuan chu thu rawn hrilhtu tlangvâl hnênah chuan, “Saula leh a fapa Jonathana engtin nge an thi tih i hriat?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hrilhtu tlangvâl chuan, “Gilboa tlângah ka va kal hlauh va, Saula chu a fei rinchhanin a ding a; chutih lai chuan tawlailîr leh sakawr chungchuang mite chuan an rawn nangchîng ṭêp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, a hawi vêl ruai a, mi hmu ta a, mi han au va, ‘Eng nge ni ta le?’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan, ‘Tu nge i nih?’ min ti a. Keiin, ‘Amalek mi ka ni,’ tiin ka chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan ka hnênah, ‘Lo kal la, mi han that mai teh; eng mah ka ni ta lo, ka dam zo dâwn lo ve,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, ka va kal a, a dam zo dâwn lo tih ka hriat avângin ka that ta a. A lallukhum khum lai leh a bânbun lai chu ka la a, hei ka pu, i hnênah ka rawn thlen a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Davida chuan a silhfênte a pawtthlêr a, a hnêna mi awm zawng zawngte pawh chuan an puan an pawtthlêr ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Saula leh a fapa Jonathana te leh Lalpa mi, Israel-te chu khandaiha an thah avângin an sûn a, an ṭah a, tlai thlengin chaw an nghei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Davida chuan chûng thu rawn hrilhtu tlangvâl hnênah chuan, “Khawi lam mi nge i nih?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Ram dang mi, Amalek hnam ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Davida chuan, “ Lalpa hriakthih tihlum tûra a chunga kutthlâk engtiziaa hlau lo nge i nih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Davida chuan a mite zînga mi pakhat a ko va, “Kal la, va that rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, a va sât hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Davida chuan a hnênah, “I thisen chhuah man chu nangmah ngeiin tuar ang che; nangmah ngeiin, ‘ Lalpa hriakthih chu ka that a ni’ tiin i sawi si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Davida chuan Saula leh a fapa Jonathana chu heti hian a ṭah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chu ṭah hla chu Juda thlahte zirtîr tûrin a hrilh a, chu chu Jasar bu-ah ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Israel mi ropui chu tlângah an that a, mi chak, huaisente pawh an tlûk tâk hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gath khuaah hril suh ula, Askelon kawtthlêrah puang hek suh u; Filistia nuho an lâwm ang a, Serh tan lohho fanute an hlim dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gilboa tlângahte chuan ruah leh dai tla suh se, Loahte eng mah rah suh se, Tah chuan mi huaisen phaw mualpho takin an thehthal a, Saula phaw chu an tuaihnûm ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jonathana thalah mi huaisen thau leh thisen A kai luai ṭhîn, Saula khandaih pawhin râl a hlah ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Saula leh Jonathana chu an inhmangaih êm êm a, An thih pawhin, an dam pawhin an inṭhen lo, Mupui aiin an ṭuan a ṭha, Sakeibaknei aiin an chak zâwk bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangni, Israel nute u, Saula hi ṭah teh u, Puan senduk mawi takin a tuam che u a, Rangkachaka cheimawi puan a sintîr che u kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi huaisente indonaah an thi ta e, Jonathana pawh tlângah chuan an that ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aw, ka unaupa Jonathan, ka va han lainat tak che êm! Ka tân i hlu êm êm a, I mi hmangaihna chu a mak a, Nu hmangaihna pawhin a tluk lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi huaisente chu an tlu a, An râlthuamte pawh an thlah ta e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Davidan Lalpa hnênah, “Judai ram khaw puiahte chuan ka han chho ang em?” tiin a zâwt a. Lalpa chuan, “Chho ta che,” a ti a. Davida chuan “Khawiah nge ka han kal ang?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Hebron-ah” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chu a nupui pahnih, Jezreel mi Ahinoami leh Karmel tlânga Nabala nupui thihsan Abigaili hruaiin chutah chuan a han chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Davida chuan a mi, a ṭhuihruaite chu, an chhûngte ṭheuh nên a hruai bawk a; Hebron leh a chhehvêl khuaahte chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judai ram mite chu an lo kal a, Davida chu Judai ram lal atân hriak an thih ta a. Jabes-gilead mite chuan Saula an phûm tih Davida chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ani chuan Jabes-gilead mite hnênah mi a tîr a, “In pu, Saula chungah in rinawm hle a, ani chu in lo phûm tâk avângin Pathianin malsâwm che u rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan khawngaih che uin a rinawmzia in chungah lantîr zêl sela, he thil in lo tih avâng hian kei pawhin in chungah ṭhat ka chhuah ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tûnah ngaihngam takin awm ula, zâm rêng rêng suh u. In pu Saula chu thi tawh mah se, kei hi Juda mite chuan an lal atân hriak min thih ta a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Nera fapa Abnera, Saula sipai hotu chuan Isboseta chu Jordan ral Mahanaim hmunah a rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gilead-ah te, Aser-ah te, Jezreel-ah te, Efraim-ah te, Benjamin ramah te leh Israel ram zawng zawng chunga lal atân a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saula fapa Isboseta chu Israel lal a nih tirh chuan kum sawmlina upa a ni; kum hnih chhûng a lal a. Juda mite erawh chuan Davida chu lalah an pawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Davida chu Hebron khuaah kum sarih leh thla ruk lai Juda mite chungah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nera fapa Abnera chu Saula fapa Isboseta mite nên Mahanaim aṭangin Gibeon-ah an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zeruii fapa Joaba leh Davida mite pawh an lo kal a, Gibeon dîl kamah an intâwk a. Ho khat dîl râl lehlamah an ṭhu a, a ho dang râl lehlamah an ṭhu bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abnera chuan Joaba hnênah, “Tlangvâlte chu zât leh zâtin thlang chhuak ila, kan hmaah han inbei teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Benjamin lamṭangte chu mi sâwm leh pahnih an lo chhuak a, chutiang bawkin Davida lamṭangte pawh an lo chhuak bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mahni khingpui ṭheuh lu-ah an ṭhâm a, an bitum ṭheuhte nên chuan an invit a, an thi za ta vek a. Chuvâng chuan, chu hmun chu Helkat-Hazurim an ti ta a, chu chu Gibeon-a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan nasa takin an inbei ta a, Davida mite chuan Abnera leh Israel mite chu an hneh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chu inbeihnaah chuan Zeruii fapa pathum Joaba te, Abisaia te, Asahela te an tel a, Asahela chu zukpui ang maia ngalchak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asahela chuan ding lamah emaw, vei lamah emaw pawh pêng lovin Abnera chu a ûm ngat ngat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Abnera chu a han lehhawi a, “Nang i ni maw, Asahel,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Ni e,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ding lamah emaw, vei lamah emaw min pênsan la, tlangvâl pakhat kha man mai la, a râlthuam hlihsak rawh,” a ti a. Asahela chuan a ûm chu a bânsan duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abnera chuan Asahela hnênah, “Min ûm tawh suh, ka that palh ang che, i u Joaba hmêl ka hmu ngam dâwn em ni?” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mahse, Asahela chuan a ûm lui zêl a; Abnera chuan a fei hmâwr zum lo lamin a pumah a lo chhun a, fei chu a hnungah a tlang a, chumi hmunah chuan a tlu tawp a, a thi ta a. Asahela a tlûka, a thihna hmun lo thleng apiang chu an ding chawt zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Joaba leh Abisaia chuan Abnera chu an la ûm zêl a, Gibeon thlalêr panna Gia chhak lama Ama tlâng an thlenin ni a tla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Benjamin thlahte chu Abnera bulah chuan an pung khâwm a, pâwl khata insiamin tlângchhîpah ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Abnera chuan Joaba chu a au va, “Kan inbei reng dâwn em ni? Hei hian a tâwpa inhuatna mai lo chu eng mah sâwtna a awm lo tih i ngaihtuah na nge? Engtikah nge mite chu an unaute ûm tawh lo tûra i hrilh dâwn?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Joaba chuan, “Pathian nung chhâlin ka sawi e, eng mah sawi lo la chu, mite chuan naktûk zîng thlengin an unaute an la ûm dâwn asin le’” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, Joaba chuan tawtawrâwt a han hâm a, a mite chu an ding ṭhup a, Israel-te chu an ûm ta lo va, an bei leh ta hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abnera leh a mite chu zankhuain an kal a, Araba an kal tlang a, Jordan lui an kân a, nilêngin an kal leh a, Mahanaim chu an thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Joaba chuan Abnera a ûm chu a kîrsan a, a mite chu a ko khâwm vek a, Asahela bâkah Davida mite sâwm leh pakua lai an kim lo tih a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Davida hote erawh chuan Benjamin hnam Abnera hote chu mi zathum leh sawmruk lai an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Asahela ruang chu an la a, Bethlehem-a a pa thlânah an phûm a, Joaba leh a mite chu zankhuain an kal a, a tûk khawvârah chuan Hebron an thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saula chhûngte leh Davida chhûngte chu rei tak an indo va, Davida chu a chak tial tial a, Saula chhûngte chu an chak lo tial tial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Davida chuan Hebron-a an awm laiin fapa paruk a nei a. A u ber chu Amnona, Jezreel mi Ahinoami laka mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A dawttu chu Kileaba, Karmel tlânga Nabala thihsan a nupui Abigaili laka mi a ni. A pathumna chu Absaloma, Gesur lal, Talmaia fanu Maaki laka mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A palina chu Adonija, Hagiti hrin a ni. A pangana chu Sefatia, Abitali hrin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A parukna chu Ithreama, Davida nupui Ekli laka mi a ni; hêng hi Davida fa, Hebron-a piangte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saula chhûngte leh Davida chhûngte chu an indo zêl a, Saula chhûngte zîngah Abnera chuan thu a nei ta tial tial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saula chuan hmei a nei a, a hming chu Rizpii a ni a, Aii fanu a ni a. Isboseta chuan Abnera hnênah, “Engtizia nge ka pa hmei i mutpui le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Isboseta thu sawi avâng chuan Abnera chu a thinrim hle a, a hnênah, “Juda lamṭang uicho em ka nih, tûn thlengin i pa Saula chhûngte, a unaute leh a ṭhiante tân rinawm takin ka thawk a, nang pawh Davida kutah ka hlân lo che a; mahse, nang chuan he hmeichhe laka sualah min puh vei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa thu lo thlun tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />lalna chu Saula chhûngte hnên ata chhuhsaka Israel leh Judai ram, Dan aṭanga Beer-seba thlenga Davida lalṭhutthlêng tungding tûra ka tihhlawhtlin loh vaih chuan Pathianin Abnera chu na takin khawih sela, tihlum hial rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Isboseta chuan kamkhat pawhin a chhâng lo, Abnera chu a hlau hle si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Abnera chuan Davida hnênah palai a tîr ta a, a hnênah, “He ram hi tu ta nge? Inremna siam ila, Israel mi zawng zawng i lama ṭang tûrin ka beihpui ang che,” a ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Aw le, nang nêna inremna kan siam dân tûr chu hetiang hi ni rawh se: mi hmu tûra i lo kal hunah Saula fanu Mikali rawn hruai ngei ngei ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Davida chuan Saula fapa Isboseta hnênah, “Ka nupui, Mikali, Filistia mi serh vun zaa ka lei kha min rawn pe rawh,” tiin mi a tîr bawk a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Isboseta chuan, a pasal Paltiela, Laisa fapa hnên ata chu chhuhsak tûrin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A pasal chuan ṭap chungin Bahurim thlengin a zui a, Abnera chuan a hnênah, “Kîrsan tawh rawh,” a ti a: tichuan, a kîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abnera chuan Israel upaho chu a berâwn a, an hnênah, “Tûn hma khân Davida chu in lalah in duh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tûnah lalah nei tawh rawh u le, Lalpa chuan Davida hnênah thu a thlung a, ‘Ka chhiahhlawh Davida chuan, ka mi Israel-te chu Filistia mite kut ata leh an hmêlmate kut ata a chhan chhuak ang,’ a tih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abnera chuan Benjamina thlahte pawh a bia a. Tichuan, Israel mite leh Benjamin chhûngte chuan ṭha an tih thu hrilh tûrin Hebron khuaa Davida hnênah an va kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Abnera chu mi sawmhnih hruaiin Hebrona Davida hnênah a kal ta a, Davida chuan ruai a lo ṭhehsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abnera chuan Davida hnênah, “Ka va chhuak ang a, ka pu, lal tân hian Israel mi zawng zawng ka va ko khâwm ang a; tichuan, anni nên chuan inremna in siam ang a, a ṭha i tih ang takin an chungah ro i rêl dâwn nia,” a ti a. Davida chuan Abnera chu ngaihṭha takin a kal chhuahtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Joaba leh Davida sipai ṭhenkhat, an rammu an lo hâwng a, râllâk sum tam tak an rawn hâwn a. Abnera chu Hebron khuaah Davida hnênah a lo awm tawh lo va; ani chu Davida chuan a chhuahtîr a, ngaihngam takin a kal chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joaba leh a sipaite an lo thlen chuan, “Nera fapa Abnera chu lal hmaah a lo kal a, lal chuan a chhuahtîr a, ngaihngam takin a kal ta,” tih an lo hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Joaba chu lal hnênah a kal a, “I thil lo tih hi engtizia nge ni le? Ngai teh Abnera chu i hmaah a lo kal a, engtizia nge i chhuahtîr leh mai? Hei, a bo leh daih tawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nera fapa Abnera hi tu nge a nih i hria a, nangmah bum tumin, i chettlat dân leh i thiltih zawng zawng hriat tumin a lo kal a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Davida hnên ata a chhuah hnu chuan Joaba chuan Abnera ûm tûrin mi a tîr a; Sira tuichhunchhuah aṭangin ani chu an rawn hruai kîr a. Davida chuan chu chu a hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abneran Hebron a lo thlen chuan Joaba chuan kulh kawngkhâr bulah a fâla biak tum ni âwm takin a hruai a; tichuan, a unau Asahela a lo thah phuba chu a la ta a, Joaba chuan a dulah a vit a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Davidan chu thu chu a lo hriat chuan, “Nera fapa Abnera thah thu-ah kei leh ka ram chu Lalpa mit hmuhin kan thiang kumkhua ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A thisen mawh chu Joaba leh a pa chhûngte chungah tla rawh se, Joaba chhûngte zîngah panchhe vei te, phâr te, ramtuileilo te, khandaiha thi te, ṭâm tuarte awm reng rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Joaba leh a u Abisaia chuan Gibeon indonaah an nau Asahela chu Abneran a thah avângin an that ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Davida chuan Joaba leh a hnêna sipai zawng zawng hnênah, “In puante pawtthlêr ula, saiip puan sinin Abnera vui tûrin a hmaah kal rawh u,” a ti a. Lal Davida pawhin hlâng chu a zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Abnera chu Hebron-ah an phûm a; a thlânah lal chu ring takin a ṭap a, mipui zawng zawng an ṭap bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lal chuan Abnera chu hetiangin a ṭah a: “Engtizia nge Abnera chu mi â thiha a thih tâk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />I kut phuar a ni lo, i ke hlin a ni hek lo, mi sualte kut tuar ang maiin i thih tâk le?” a ti a; tichuan, mi zawng zawng chuan an ṭah leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chhûnah chuan Davida chu eng emaw tal ei tûrin an ngên a; mahse, hetiangin thu a lo tiam tawh a, “Ni tlâk hma chu chaw pawh, thil dang pawh, eng mah ka ei lo vang, ka ei chuan Pathianin a tih tihin min ti rawh se, na tak pawhin ka chungah ti rawh se,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi zawng zawngin chutianga a tih chu an hria a, an lâwm a, lal thiltih dân chuan mipui a tilâwm hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan mipui leh Israel mi zawng zawngin Nera fapa Abnera thah chungchângah lalin inhnamhnawihna a nei lo tih an hre chiang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Lal chuan a mite hnênah, “Vawiin hian Israel milian, mi ropui tak a thi tih in hre na nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lal atân hriak min thih hlim a ni a, ka la chak lo va, Zeruii fate hi an huangtau lutuk ta deuh a ni. Lalpa chuan thil sual titute chu an thiltihin a phu ang ngeiin hrem rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saula fapa Isboseta chuan Abnera chu Hebron-ah an that tih a lo hriat chuan a thlaphâng ta hle a. Israel mi zawng zawng pawh an mangang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saula fapa Isboseta chuan rammu pâwl hotu pahnih a nei a, an hming chu Baana leh Rekaba an ni. Chûng mite chu Benjamin thlah Beerot mi Rimona fapate an ni. Beerot chu Benjamin ram chhûnga ngaih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Beerot khuaa awmte chu Gitaim-ah an tlân a, tûn thlengin chutah chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saula fapa Jonathana chuan fapa a nei a, ani chu a ke a bai a. Saula leh Jonathana thih thu Jezreel aṭanga an hriat lai chuan ani chu kum nga mi a ni. A awmtunu chuan a pawm a, a tlânchhia a, a hmanhmawh lutukna lamah a thlauh a; tichuan, a ke a lo bai ta a ni. A hming chu Mefiboseta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Beerot khaw mi Rimona fapa Rekaba leh Baana chu Isboseta in lam panin an chhuak a; chu chu ni sat vânglai tak a ni. Isboseta chu a chhûn chawlh lai a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kawngkhâr vêngtu hmeichhia chu a mut a chhuak hle a, a buhthlei lai chu a lo muthlu a; chutih lai chuan Rekaba leh a nau Baana chu an lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pindanah an lût a, Isboseta chu a mut pindana tui taka a mu lai chu a dulah an vit a, an that ta a. A lu an tansak a, an la a, Araba lam kawngah zânkhuain an kalpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Isboseta lu chu Hebron khuaa Davida hnênah an rawn thlen a, lal hnênah chuan, “Hei, i hmêlma, thah tumtu che Saula fapa Isboseta lu kan rawn hâwn e. Ka pu, lal phuba chu, Lalpa chuan vawiin hian Saula leh a thlahte chungah a la ta a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Davida chuan Berot khaw mi Rimona fapa Rekaba leh a nau Baana chu heti hian a chhâng a, “Ka manganna tinrêng laka min chhanchhuaktu Lalpa , mi nung hmingin ka sawi e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />thu lâwmawm rawn thlenah inngaiin, ‘Saula chu a thi ta’ tih thu rawn sawitu chu ka lo man a, Ziklag khuaah ka that a, chu chu a thu ‘Lâwmawm’ a rawn thlen mana ka pêk chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawisawi lo, ama in chhûng lum, a khumlaizâwla mu lai ngei thattu, nangni mi sual lakah hian a thisen phuba chu ka va han la dâwn tehrêng êm! Tûnah hian leilung ata ka tiboral dâwn che u a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Davida chuan a sipaite chu thu a pe a, an kut leh kete an tan a, an ruang chu Hebron dîl kamah an khai a, Isboseta lu erawh chu an la a, Hebron khuaah, Abnera thlânah chuan an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel hnam zawng zawng chu Davida hnênah Hebron-ah chuan an lo kal a, a hnênah, “I thisen zawmpuite kan ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tûn hmaa Saula kan chunga a lal lai khân Israel-te chu an rammutnaah i hruai ṭhîn a. Lalpa chuan i hnênah, ‘Ka mi Israel-te hi i kaihruai ang a, an chungah i lal ang,’ a tih che kha,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel upa zawng zawng chu Hebron khuaah lal hnênah an lo kal a, lal chuan anni chu Hebron khuaah chuan thu a lo thlunpui a, Davida chu Israel lal atân hriak an thih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Davida chu lal a lo nih khân kum sawmthuma upa a ni, kum sawmli chhûng ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hebron-ah Juda-te chungah kum sarih leh thla ruk a lal a, Jerusalem-ah Israel leh Juda-te chungah kum sawmthum leh pathum a lal bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lal leh a mite chu, chu lai hmuna chêng Jebus-ho bei tûrin Jerusalem an pan ta a. Davida chu a luh theih loh ringin a hnênah, “Hetah hian i lo lût tawp lo vang, mitdel leh kebaite pawhin an lo dang thei ang che,” an lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mahse, Davida chuan Zion kulh chu a la ta mai a, chu chu Davida khawpui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Davidan a hote hnênah, “Tu pawh Jebus-hote ka huat anga huaa thah duh chu anmahni bei tûrin tuiluankawr lamah chho sela, ka hmêlma, mitdel leh kebaite chu bei rawh se,” a ti a. Chuvâng chuan alâwm, ‘mitdel leh kebaite chu’ Lalpa inah an lût ve thei lo vang,” an tih tâk ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Davida chu kulhah chuan a awm a, “Davida khawpui” tih a lo ni ta a. Davida chuan a vêlin kulh a siam a, Milo aṭangin lal in thlengin a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Davida chu a lo ropui deuh deuh va, Engkim Lalpa chu a hnênah a awm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tura lal Hirama chuan Davida hnênah mi a tîr a, Sidar thing te, kut themthiam te, lungchher thiamte a thawn a, Davida in chu an saksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Davida chuan amah chu Israel-te lal atân Lalpan a tinghet a, a mi Israel-te avângin ram chu a chawimawi a ni tih a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hebron a chhuahsan hnu chuan Davida chuan hmei leh nupui, Jerusalem-ah a neih belh a, fanu fapa a nei ta ṭeuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hêng hi Jerusalem-a a fa neihte chu an ni: Samua te, Sobaba te, Nathana te, Solomona te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ibhara te, Elisua te, Nefega te, Jafia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elisama te, Eliada te, Elifeleta te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel miten Davida chu lal atân hriak an thih tih an hriatin Filistia mi zawng zawng chu Davida bei tûrin an lo thawk a, chu chu Davidan a lo hria a, kulhbîngah a chhuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Filistia mite chu Refaim ruamah an inzâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Davida chuan Lalpa hnênah, “Filistia mite chu ka zu bei ang em, ka kutah anni chu mi pe dâwn em?” tiin a zâwt a. Lalpa chuan, “Kal rawh, Filistia-ho chu i kutah ka pe ngei dâwn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chu Baal-perazim-ah a kal a, chutah chuan Filistia-ho chu a hneh a, “Tuikhuah sah ang maiin Lalpa chuan ka hmêlmate min tihdarhsak ta,” a ti a, chu hmun chu Baal-perazim a vuah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Filistia mite chuan an pathian lemte an tlânchhiatsan a, Davida leh a mite chuan an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Filistia mite chu an lo chho leh a, Refaim ruamah an inzâr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Davida chuan Lalpa chu a râwn leh a, ani chuan, “Va pan mai suh, an hnung lamah hual la, thingtheihmu hmun aṭangin anni chu bei ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, thingtheihmu lêr aṭanga kal ri ṭhup ṭhup ang thâwm i hriat veleh bei thut rawh, chu chu Filistia-ho bei tûrin Lalpa chu i hmaah a kal tihna a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Davida chuan Lalpa thupêk ang chuan a ti a, Filistia mite chu Geba aṭanga Gezer thlengin a ûm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida chuan Israel-te zîng aṭanga mi sîngthum a thlante chu a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Davida leh a mite chu Judai rama Baala khuaa Pathian Bâwm, Engkim Lalpa , cherub chunga chuang hming chuanna chu la tûrin an thawk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian Bâwm chu tawlailîr tharah an dah a, tlânga Abinadaba in ata chu an la chhuak a, Abinadaba fapa Uza leh Ahioa chuan tawlailîr thar chu an khalh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahioa chu Pathian Bâwm hma lamah chuan a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Davida leh Israel mi zawng zawng chuan ri thei chi hrang hrang: ṭingṭang te, perhkhuang te, khuangtê te, darbenthek te leh tawtawrâwt te nên nasa takin Lalpa an fak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nakona hruihzâwl an thlen chuan bâwngpa chu a petek avângin Uza chuan a kut a phar chhuak a, Pathian Bâwm chu a va dawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chu, Uza chungah, a tih dik loh avâng chuan, a thinur ta thut a; chutah chuan Pathianin a tihlum a, Pathian Bâwm bulah chuan a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa thinur chu Uza chunga a tlâk avângin Davida chu a thinur hle a, chu hmun chu Perez-uza a vuah a, tûn thlengin a hmingah a la pu ta reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Lalpa chu a hlau hle a, “Engtin nge Lalpa Bâwm chu ka hawn theih tâk ang le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian Bâwm chu Davida khawpuiah chuan a hâwnpui duh ta lo va. Git mi Obed-edoma inah a dah ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa Bâwm chu Git mi, Obed-edoma inah chuan thla thum a awm a, Obed-edoma te chhûngkua chu Lalpa chuan mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Pathian Bâwm avângin Lalpan Obed-edoma chhûngkua leh a in-leh-lo zawng zawng chu mal a sâwm a ni,” tiin Davida an hrilh a. Davida chuan Pathian Bâwm chu Obed-edoma in aṭangin Davida khawpuiah lâwm takin a la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa Bâwm zâwntuten bâwm chu pên ruk an han kalpui a, Davida chuan a dintîr rih a, bâwngpa leh ran chawm thau inthawina a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Davida chuan puan zai sîna siam puithiam kawr a inbel a, a theihtâwpa nasain Lalpa hmaah chuan a lâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Davida leh Israel mite chuan hlim taka auva, tawtawrâwt hâm chung zêlin Lalpa Bâwm chu an la chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa Bâwm chu Davida khawpuia an luhpui lai chuan Saula fanu Mikali chuan tukverh aṭangin a lo thlîr a; Lalpa hmaa Davida zuang leh lâm chu a hmusit rilru hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa Bâwm chu an la lût a, a dahna tûra Davida zâr, puan in chhûngah chuan an dah a; Davida chuan Engkim Lalpa hnênah hâlral thilhlan te, remna thilhlan te a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hlan zawh chuan Engkim Lalpa hmingin mipui tân malsâwmna a dîlsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel mipui zawng zawng, a hmei a pain, mi tin hnênah chhang hlawm khat leh sahrang khat leh grep rah pho ro hlawm khat a pe a. Tichuan, mahni in lamah an hâwng ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A chhûngte tân malsâwmna dîlsak tûrin Davida chu a lo haw chuan Saula fanu Mikali chu amah hmuak tûrin a lo chhuak a, a hnênah, “Vawiin chu Israel lal a va han intiropui ve le! Zah nachâng hre lo mite ang maiin a chhiahhlawh nulate hmuhah saruaka a tal chiam le!” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Davida chuan Mikali hnênah, “I pa leh a chhûngte zawng zawng aia Israel-te chunga lala min thlangtu Lalpa hmaah asin ka lâm; Lalpa chu ka chawimawi zêl dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tûn ai mah hian zahpuiawm min la ti ang; engah mah min ngai lo na ang a, hêng chhiahhlawh nula i sawite hian min ngaisâng ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, Saula fanu Mikali chuan a thih thlengin fa a nei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal chu a inah a awm a, Lalpa chuan a hmêlma zawng zawng lakah râlmuang takin a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal chuan zâwlnei Nathana hnênah, “Kei chu Sidar thinga sak inah ka awm a, Pathian Bâwm erawh chu puan in maiah a awm si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nathana chuan lal hnênah, “Ṭha i tih ang chuan va ti rawh, Lalpa chu i hnênah a awm alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chumi zan vek chuan Lalpa chuan Nathana hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ka chhiahhlawh Davida chu hetiang hian va hrilh rawh. Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ka chên nân in mi saksak i tum em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel fate Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah aṭangin tûn thlengin inah ka awm lo va, hmun hrang hrangah te awm sawnin puan inah te ka awm zâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmun hrang hranga ka vah kualpui Israel fate leh ka mi Israel-te enkawltu atâna ka ruat rorêltute hnenah, ‘Engati nge Sidar thing in min saksak loh?’ ka ti ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tûnah ka chhiahhlawh Davida chu hetiang hian hrilh rawh: Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘I berâm vênna hmun ata, ka mi Israel-te chunga rorêl tûrin ka ko che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I vahvêlna apiangah i hnênah ka awm ṭhîn a, i hmaa hmêlma awmte chu ka hnehsak ṭhîn che a; tûnah, leia mi ropuite angin i hming ka tiropui dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mi Israel-te chu an awm hlenna tûr ram ka pe ang a, tu ma tihbuai lohvin thlamuang takin an awm tawh ang. Tûn hma ang khân mi sualten an hnehchhiah tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mite chunga rorêltute ka ruat ṭhin lai ang khân an awm hek lo vang. In hmelmate lak ata thlamuang takin in awm tawh ang a; chu bâkah, kei Lalpa hian i chhûngkua chu ka tungding ang tih ka hrilh a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I ni a kina i pute hnêna i chawlh hunah nangmah thlâktu zînga mi, i rîla rah ngei chu, ka tungding ang a, a ram chu ka tinghet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani chuan ka tân in mi saksak ang a, a ram chu kumkhua atân ka tinghet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pa ka ni ang a, ani chu ka fapa a ni ang. Thil a tihsual chuan pain an fate an tiang hmanga an thunun angin ka thunun ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“I hma ata Saula ka la bo va, ka khawngaihna a hnên ata ka la kîr angin ani zawng ka khawngaihna chuan a kalsan lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I chhûngkua leh i ram chu kumkhuain ka tinghet ang a, i lalṭhutthlêng chu nghet takin a awm reng ang,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathianin a hrilh zawng zawng chu Nathana chuan Davida chu a hrilh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal Davida chu Lalpa inah a lût a, a ṭhu a, hetiang hian a ṭawngṭai a. “Aw, Lalpa Pathian, kei leh ka chhûngte hi eng nge maw kan niha, hetiang taka min ngaihnat le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Lalpa Pathian, chu chu tâwk ti lovin i chhiahhlawh thlahte leh zêl pawh din ngheh i la tum ta fo va. Aw Lalpa Pathian, hei hi i mite i hruai dân a lo ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Davida chuan i hnênah eng nge a sawi leh chuan tâk ang? Aw Lalpa Pathian, i chhiahhlawh hi i hre vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I thu leh i duh dân angin he thil ropui tak hi i ti a, i chhiahhlawh i hriattîr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw Lalpa Pathian, i va ropui tak êm! Nang ang hi tu mah an awm kan hre lo, nang lo chu Pathian dang an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An saltânna ata i mi atâna i hruai chhuah Israel hnam ang hi khawvêlah an awm lo. An tân thil ropui leh mak tak tak i ti a, lei pum puiah i hming a lo thang ta. Aigupta ram ata i pual atân i hruai chhuahte hmaah chuan hnam dangte chu an pathiante chawpin i hnawt bo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I mi Israel-te chu kumkhuaa i ta ni tûrin i tinghet a; Aw Lalpa , nang chu an Pathian i lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tûnah, Lalpa Pathian, i chhiahhlawh leh a chhûngte chungchânga thu i lo tiam tawh chu kumkhua atân hlen la, i lo sawi tawh ang chuan ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chu Israel-te Pathian a ni, tiin i hming chawimawi kumkhua sela; tichuan, i chhiahhlawh Davida chhûngte chu i tân din nghet ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aw Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, i chhiahhlawh hnênah hian, ‘I chhûngkua chu ka tungding ang,’ tiin i lo hrilh tawh a, chuvâng alâwm ngênngâwl taka hei hi ka dîl che ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aw Lalpa Pathian, nang chu Pathian i ni a, i thute chu a rinawm a, i chhiahhlawh hnênah he thu hlu tak hi i tiam ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh chhûngte hian i duhsakna an dawn reng theih nân khawngaih takin malsâwm ang che. Aw Lalpa Pathian, nangin i tiam tawh a, i chhiahhlawh chhûngte hi kumkhuain malsâwm ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hnuah Davida chuan Filistia mite a hneh a, an tlâwm ta a. Metheg-ama chu Filistia mite a chhuhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab mite a hneh bawk a, mi an mante chu leiah a muttîr a, hruiin a hlîng a, a chhiar vek a, pathuma pahnih chu a that a, a dang zawng chu a zuah a. Moab mite chu Davida thuhnuaiah an awm ta a, a hnênah chhiah an chawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zoba lal Rehoba fapa Hadadezera chu Eufretis chhak lama a ram la lêt leh tûrin a kal a, Davida chuan a lo bei bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Davida chuan sakawr chungchuang mi sângkhat leh zasarih leh sipai sînghnih a mansak a, tawlailîr za hnûktu atân sakawr za a zuah a, a dang zawng chu an tha a chhahsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Damaska khua aṭanga Zoba lal, lal Hadadezera chhan tûra Suria mi lo kalte chu sînghnih leh sânghnih a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Suria ram Damaska khuaah chuan a sipaite a dah a, Suria mite chu a thuhnuaiah an awm ta a, a hnênah chhiah an chawi ṭhîn a. Lalpan a ṭanpui avângin Davida chuan a râl do a hneh zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Davida chuan Hadadezera hote chu an rangkachak phawte a lâksak a, Jerusalem-ah a hâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Hadadezera awp khua Beta leh Berothai aṭangin lal Davida chuan dâr tam tak a hâwn bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hamath lal Toia chuan Hadadezera sipai zawng zawng Davidan a hneh tih a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toia chuan vawi tam tak a lo do ṭhin Hadadezera chu a hneh avângin lawmpuina chibai bûk tûrin a fapa Jorama chu a tîr a. Jorama chuan tangkarua leh rangkachak leh dâra siam hmanraw tam tak a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chûng chu ram hrang hrang a hnehte hnên ata tangkarua leh rangkachak a lâkte nên lal Davida chuan Lalpa a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hneh rama mite chu, Edom mi te, Moab mi te, Amon mi te, Filistia mi te, Amalek-ho te an ni. Zoba lal Rehoba fapa Hadadezera laka a râllâk pawh a hlân bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Davida chuan chi ruamah Edom mi sîngkhat leh sângriat lai a that a, chuta chin chu a hmingthang ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Edom ram hmun hrang hrangah sipai a dah a, Edom mite chu Davida khua leh tui an lo ni ta a. Lalpa chuan Davida chu a kalna apiangah a hnehtîr zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Davida chuan Israel ram pum puiah ro a rêl a, a mite chungah chuan dik tak leh ṭha takin ro a rêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zeruii fapa Joaba chu sipai hotu a ni a, Ahiluda fapa Jehosafata chu chanchin ziaktu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahituba fapa Zadoka leh Abiathara fapa Ahimeleka chu puithiam an ni a, Seraia chu ziaktu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu Keret mi leh Pelet mite hotu a ni. Davida fapate chu khâwnbâwl an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Saula chhûngte zîngah dam an la awm em aw? Jonathana avângin ka khawngaih dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saula chhûngkuate chhiahhlawh, a hming Ziba a awm a, Davida hnêna kal tûrin an ko va, lal chuan a hnênah, “Ziba i ni em?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Pathian khawngaihna a chunga ka lantîr theih nân, Saula chhûngte zîngah dam an la awm em? a ti a. Ziba chuan lal hnênah, “Jonathana fapa pakhat a awm, a ke a bai nghe nghe asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal chuan a hnênah, “Khawiah nge a awm?” a ti a. Ziba chuan lal hnênah, “Amiela fapa Makira in Lo-debar khuaah a awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal Davida chuan Amiela fapa Makira in Lo-debar khua ata chu hruai tûrin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saula fa Jonathana fapa Mefiboseta chu Davida hnênah chuan a lo kal a, kûnin chibai a bûk a, Davida chuan, “Mefiboset,” a ti a. Ani chuan “Eng nge ka pu?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Davida chuan a hnênah, “Hlau suh aw, i pa Jonathana avângin i chungah ṭhat chhuah ka duh a ni. I pu Saula ram zawng zawng chu ka pe ang chia, ka hnênah i eiin i in bawk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mefiboseta chuan chibai a bûk leh a “Kei, ui thisâwn ang lek, i chhiahhlawh hi eng emaw ka niha, heti taka mi i ngaihsak le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal chuan Saula chhiahhlawh Ziba chu a ko va, a hnênah, “I pu Saula ram zawng zawng leh an chhûngkaw thil neih zawng zawng hi a tupa hnênah hian ka pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang leh i fate leh i chhiahhlawhte chuan ram chu in enkawlsak ang a, thlai thar chu i pu tupa chhûngte tân in rawn la ang a, Mefiboseta erawh chuan ka hnênah a eiin a in ve ang,” a ti a. Ziba chuan fapa sâwm leh panga leh chhiahhlawh sawmhnih a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ziba chuan lal hnênah, “I chhiahhlawh hian, ka pu, nang lalin tih tûr min ruatsak apiang chu ka ti zêl ang,” a ti a. Mefiboseta erawh chu lal fate ang bawkin Davida inah chuan a eiin a in ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mefiboseta chuan fapa la naupang tak a nei a, a hming chu Mika a ni. Ziba ina awm zawng zawng chu Mefiboseta chhiahhlawh an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mefiboseta chu Jerusalem-ah a awm ve ta a, lal inah chuan a eiin a in ṭhîn a, a ke khinghnih a ṭha lo a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng hnu chuan Amon mite lal chu a thi a, a fapa Hanuna chu a aiah a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Davida chuan, “A pain min lo khawngaih angin kei pawhin Nahasa fapa Hanuna chu ka khawngaih ve ang,” tih thu hrilh tûrin Hanuna hnênah mi a tîr a. Davida mi tirhten Amon ram an lo thlen chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amon thlah hruaitute chuan an pu Hanuna hnênah, “Davida hian i pa a zah avângin nangmah thlamuantu tûr i hnênah a rawn tîr a nih i ring em? Davida hian khawpui rawn en thlithlaia tihchhiatna zawngin enthlatu a rawn tîr a ni mai lo vang maw?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hanuna chuan Davida mi tirhte chu a man ta mai a, an khabehmul ṭhenkhat a mehsak a, an silhfênte chu a laiah a tanbunsak a, mawng lang rengin a hâwntîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu thu chu Davida an hrilh a, ani chuan hmuak tûrin mi a tîr a, anni chu an zak hle a. Lal chuan, “In khabehmul a chawr sei hma chu Jeriko-ah awm rih ula, chumi hnuah in lo hâwng dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amon mite chuan Davida hmêlma an ni ta tih an inhriat chuan Beth-rehob leh Zoba-a mi, Suria sipai sînghnih leh Maaka-a mi sângkhat leh Tob mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih an chah a, an ruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu thu chu Davidan a hriat chuan Joaba chu, a sipai indo mi zawng zawng nên a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amon mite chu an lo thawk a, khawpui luhna kawngkhâr bulah ṭanhmun an rem a; mi dang, Zoba leh Rehob aṭanga Suria mite, Tob mite leh Maaka mite erawh chu a hrangin phûlah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joaba chuan an hma lamah leh an hnung lamah an rawn bei dâwn tih a hriatin Israel zînga sipai ṭha ṭha a thlang chhuak a, Suria mite bei tûrin ṭanhmun a lo rem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi dang zawng zawng chu a u Abisaia kutah a dah a, Amon mite bei tûrin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joaba chuan, “Suria-ho hi ka hneh dâwn loh chuan min rawn pui ang a, Amon-ho hi i hneh dâwn loh chuan ka rawn pui ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ṭan la la, kan mite leh kan Pathian khawpui tân huaisen takin i bei ang. Lalpa chuan ṭha a tih ang zêlin ti rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Joaba leh a sipaite chu Suria-ho bei tûrin an lo thawk a, anni chu an tlânchhe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amon miten Suria-ho tlânchhia an hmuh chuan anni pawh chu Abisaia hmaah chuan an tlânchhe ve ta a. Khawpuiah chuan an tlân lût ta a. Tichuan, Joaban mi a ûm chu a kîrsan a, Jerusalem-ah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Suria mite chuan Israel-ten an hneh tih an inhriatin an inpun khâwm ṭha leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hadadezera chuan Eufretis lui ral lehlama Suria mite chu a va hruai chhuak a, Helam-ah an kal a. Chutah chuan Hadadezera sipai hotu Sobaka chuan an hma a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chu thu chu Davida an hrilh a; tichuan, Israel mi zawng zawng a khâwm a, Jordan lui kânin Helam-ah chuan a va kal a. Suria mite chuan Davida do tûrin ṭan an lo rem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mahse, Suria mite chu Israel mite hmaah chuan an tlânchhe ta a. Davida chuan Suria-ho sakawr chungchuang mi zasarih leh sipai kea kal sîngli a that a. An sipai hotu Sobaka pawh na takin a hliam a, chutah chuan a thi ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Hadadezera chhiah khaw lal zawng zawngten Israel-te hmaah an chan a chhe ta tih an hriatin Israel-ho nên inremna an siam a, Israel khua leh tuiah an awm ta a. Suria mite chuan Amon mite chu an pui ngam ta lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khua a lo ṭhâl a, indo tûra lalte an feh chhuah ṭhin hun a lo thleng a, Davida chuan Joaba chu, hotute leh Israel sipai zawng zawng nên a tîr chhuak a. Amon mite an va hneh a. Raba khua chu an hual a; Davida erawh chu Jerusalem-ah a awm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlai khat chu Davida chhun mu chu a tho va, lal in chung zâwlah chuan a lêng vêl a. Chuta ṭang chuan hmeichhe pakhat inbual lai hi a hmu a, hmeichhia chu a hmêl a ṭha hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Davida chuan tu nge a nih zâwt tûrin mi a tîr a. A mi tirh chuan, “Eliama fanu Bathsebi, Hit mi Uria nupui a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Davida chuan va hruai tûrin mi a tîr a; ani chu a hnênah an rawn hruai a; a lo mutpui a (a felloh zawha a inthen hlim a ni) Bathsebi chu a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmeichhia chu a lo rai ta a. “Nau ka pai ta,” tiin Davida chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Davida chuan Joaba hnênah, “Hit mi Uria kha rawn hâwntîr rawh,” a ti a. Joaba chuan Uria chu Davida hnênah a kaltîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Uria chu Davida hnên a lo thlen chuan Joaba chanchin te, sipaihote dinhmun te leh indona chungchâng a lo zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Davida chuan Uria hnênah, “I inah hâwng la, va châwl hahdam rawh khai,” a ti a. Uria chu lal in ata a chhuak a, lal chuan ei tûrte a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, Uria chu a pu chhiahhlawhte nên lal in kawngka bulah a mu ve a, a inah a riak duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Davida chu, “Uria a in lamah a haw duh lo,” tia an hrilh chuan Davida chuan a hnênah, “Rei tak i thangbo tawh si a, engah nge i in lamah i hâwn loh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uria chuan Davida hnênah, “Pathian Bâwm te, Israel-te leh Juda mite chu puan inah an awm a, ka pu Joaba leh kan hotute pawh ramhnuaiah an inkulh a; kei ina hâwngin ka eiin ka in ang a, ka nupui bulah ka mu bîk ang maw? Chutiang thil tih âwm loh chu ka ti tawp lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Davida chuan a hnênah, “Vawiin chu hetah châwl rih la, naktûkah i kal leh dâwn nia,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Uria chu chumi ni leh a tûk thlengin Jerusalem-ah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Davida chuan zanriah a eipui a, rui hnêp khawpin a hrai a. Chumi zân pawh chuan a ina hâwng lovin lal chhiahhlawhte zîngah chuan mu tûrin a chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tûk zîngah Davida chuan Joaba hnênah lehkha a thawn a, Uria chu a kentîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lehkhaah chuan, “Uria chu râl zualna lai berah hma tâwntîr la, an rawn beiha an thah theih nân tawlh kîrsan ang che u,” tiin a ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khua chu Joaba chuan a hual ta a, Uria chu inbeihna nasatna lai ber, hmatâwngah a ṭantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuaa mite chu an lo chhuak a, Joaba chu an rawn bei a. Davida sipai ṭhenkhat chu an rawn that a, Hit mi Uria pawh a thi tel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joaba chuan Davida hnênah indo chanchin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A mi tirh hnênah chuan, “Indo chanchin zawng zawng lal chu i hrilh zawhin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ani chu a thinur thut thei a, i hnênah, ‘Engati nge hnai têa khua chu in va beih? Kulh bang aṭangin an kâp mai ang che u tih in hre lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerubeseta fapa Abimeleka kha tu nge that kha? Hmeichhiain kulh bang aṭangin buh râwtsawmna lungin a zu vawm a, Thebez-ah khân a thi ta a ni lâwm ni? Engati nge kulh bang bula in va kal?’ tia thu a lo zawh che chuan, ‘I chhiahhlawh Hit mi Uria pawh kha a thi asin,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi tirh chu a kal a, a va thleng a, Joaban sawi tûr a tih zawng zawng chu Davida a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi tirh chuan Davida hnênah, “Mite chuan min rawn nawr a, phûlah min rawn bei a; mahse, kulh kawngkhâr bul thlengin kan nawr lêt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thal kâptute chuan kulh bang aṭangin i chhiahhlawhte chu an rawn kâp a, ṭhenkhat an thi a, i chhiahhlawh, Hit mi Uria pawh kha a thi tel ve asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Davida chuan mi tirh hnênah chuan, “Joaba hnênah heti hian va sawi rawh, ‘He thil hi tu man pawiti tehchiam suh u, indonaah chuan tu nge thi dâwn tih tu man an hre lâwk hlei nêm. Nasa lehzualin khua chu bei ula, tichhe vek rawh u,’ tiin Joaba chu va fuih rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Uria nupui chuan a pasal a thi ta tih a hriat chuan ani chu a sûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A sûn hun bi a kim chuan Davida chuan a inah a hruai a, nupui atân a nei ta a. Fapa a hrinsak a, Lalpa chu Davida thil tih dânah chuan a lâwm lo hle a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Nathana chu Davida hnênah a tîr a, Nathana chu a kal ta a. Davida hnênah chuan, “Khaw pakhatah mi pahnih an awm a; Pakhat chu a hausa hle a, pakhat erawh chu a rethei hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hausa zâwk chuan berâm tam tak leh bâwng tam tak a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A rethei zâwk erawh chuan ama suma a lei berâmnotê, a nu pakhat a nei a. A duat êm êm a, a fate zîngah an inah chuan a puitlin thlengin a chêntîr a. An ei ang ang a eiin a in ve a. A pawm a, a fanu ang maiin a duat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mikhual pakhat hi mi hausa hnênah chuan a thleng a, chu mi chuan a mikhual eipui atân ama berâm leh ran chu talh phal lovin mi rethei berâmno chu a chhuhsak a, a mikhual eipui atân a talhsak ta a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu mi hausaa chungah chuan Davida chu a thinur ta hle a, Nathana hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa hming chhâlin ka sawi e, chu mi chu thi tlâk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu thil chu a tih avâng leh khawngaihna a neih loh avângin berâmno chu a lêt liin a rûl leh tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nathana chuan Davida hnênah, “Chu mi chu nangmah hi i ni alâwm. Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: Israel-te lal atân hriak ka thih che a, Saula kut ata ka chhan chhuak che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I pu in leh lote, i pu nupuite i kutah ka pe a. Israel chhûng te leh Juda chhûng te pawh ka pe bawk che a. Hêng hi a la tlêm lutuk a nih chuan a dang pawh ka pêk belh zêl tûr che alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engati nge Lalpa thupêk zâwm lova, a mit hmuha thil ṭha lo chu i tih le? Hit mi Uria chu i that a, Amon mite khandaih chuan i tihlum a, a nupui i neihsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka thu i awih loh avâng leh Hit mi Uria nupui i neihsak avângin i thlahte chu khandaihin an thi an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘I chhûngkua aṭang ngeiin i chungah buaina ka thlentîr ang. I hmuh reng laiin i nupui ka lâksak ang che a, mi dang hnênah ka pe ang a, chhûn êngah i nupuite chu an mutpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang chuan a rûkin i ti a, kei erawh chuan Israel mi zawng zawng hmuh tûrin chhûn êngah ka ti ang,’ a ti e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Davida chuan Nathana hnênah, “ Lalpa chungah thil sual ka lo ti ta a ni,” a ti a. Nathana chuan, “ Lalpa chuan a ngaidam ta che a, i thi lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, he i thiltih hian Lalpa chu nasa taka a tihhmingchhiat avângin i fa chu a thi ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nathanan a in lama Davida a hâwnsan hnuin Lalpa chuan Uria nupui laka Davida fa chungah chuan kut a thlâk ta a, a dam lo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Davida chuan naupang tân Pathian hnênah a ngên chiam a; chaw te a nghei a, a pindanah a lût a, zankhuain chhuatah a mu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ina upaho a mutna ata kaihthawh tumin a kiangah an rawn ding a; mahse, a tho duh lo va, an hnênah pawh chaw a kîl duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ni sarih ni chuan naupang chu a thi ta a. Davida chhiahhlawhte chuan naupang thih thu hrilh chu an huphurh hle a, “Naupang a la dam lai pawh khân a hnênah thu kan sawi a, a ngaithla duh si lo va, engtin nge naupang chu a thi ta tih kan hrilh ngam ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A chhiahhlawhte an inbekbawr chu a hmuhin Davida chuan naupang chu a thi a ni tih a ring a, a chhiahhlawhte hnênah chuan, “Naupang chu a thi ta elo?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Thi ta e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Davida chu chhuat aṭangin a lo tho va, a inbual a, hriak a thih a, a thawmhnaw a inthlâk a, Lalpa inah a kal a, chibai a bûk a, inah a haw leh a, chaw ei tûr a lam a, an rawn hlui a, a ei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A chhiahhlawhte chuan a hnênah, “Engtiziaa hetianga ti nge i nih? Naupang chu a dam lai khân chaw te i nghei a, i ṭap a; mahse, naupang chu a thih veleh i lo tho va, chaw te i ei ta zâwk mai si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Naupang chu a la dam lai khân chaw te ngheiin ka ṭap ngei tak a, Lalpa chuan min khawngaih ang a, naupang chu a dam leh mial mahna ka tih vâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mahse, tûnah a thi ta a, engah nge chaw ka nghei tawh ang? Ka ko kîr leh thei em ni? Kei pawh a hnênah ka la kal dâwn, ani zawng ka hnênah a lo kîr leh dâwn tawh lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Davida chuan a nupui Bathsebi chu a hnêm a, a hnênah a kal a, a mutpui a; tichuan, fapa a hring a, a hmingah Solomona a sa a. Lalpa chuan naupang chu a hmangaih hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hmangaih avângin chu nau hmingah chuan Jedidia sa tûrin zâwlnei Nathana chu a chah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Joaba chuan Amon mite khawpui Raba chu a rûn a, lal inte a la ṭêp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Davida hnênah mi a tîr a, “Raba khua ka bei a, an tui tlan dîl lian pawh ka la ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tûnah, sipai la awm zawng zawng khâwm la, khua chu rawn hual la, rawn la rawh. Chutilo zawng, khawpui chu ka la ang a, a hmingṭhatna ka khum dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Davida chuan sipai zawng zawng a khâwm a, Raba chu a pan a, a bei a, a la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An milim pathian Milkoma rangkachak lallukhum chu a la a, a rih lam chu kg. sawmthum leh panga a ni; lunghlua chei a ni a; tin, Davida chu an khumtîr a, khawpuia mi sum tam tak a la bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chu khuaa mite chu a kawi chhuak a, thingzaina te, leilehna thîr te, hreipui te hmangin hna a thawhtîr a, leirawhchan te a siamtîr bawk a. Amon mi, khawpui danga awm zawng zawng pawh chutiang chuan a thawhtîr a. Tichuan, Davida leh a hote chu Jerusalem-ah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida fapa Absaloma chuan farnu hmêlṭha tak a nei a, a hming chu Tamari a ni. Davida fapa Amnona chuan ani chu a ngaizâwng ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A farnu Tamari a ngaihzâwn êm avângin Amnona chuan a âtchilh ta a. Tamari chu nula thianghlim a ni a, tihngaihna a hre lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amnona chuan ṭhian a nei a, a hming chu Jonadaba a ni. Ani chu Davida u Sama fapa a ni. Jonadaba chu fing vervêk tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amnona hnênah chuan, “Nang, lal fapa hi, engtizia nge a ni têla i chêr tulh tulh chu le? Eng vâng nge ni min hrilh teh,” a ti a. Amnona chuan a hnênah, “Ka unaupa Absaloma farnu Tamari hi ka ngaizâwng êm atin a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jonadaba chuan a hnênah, “Na der la, khumah mu reng la, i pain a rawn en hunah che a hnênah, ‘Khawngaih takin ka farnu Tamarin min rawn kan sela, ei tûr min rawn pe teh se, ka mit hmuhah ei tûr mi siamsak sela, a siam ngei chu ka lo ei ang e,’ lo ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Amnona chu a mu a, a na der ta a. Tin, lal chuan a va kan a, Amnona chuan lal hnênah, “Khawngaih takin ka farnu Tamari lo kal sela, ka mit hmuhah chhang min siamsak sela, a siam ngei chu ka lo ei ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal chuan lal in chhûnga awm Tamari hnênah chuan, “I nuṭa Amnona inah kal la, ei tûr va siamsak teh,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tamari chu a nuṭa Amnona inah chuan a kal ta a, ani chu a lo mu reng a. Chhangphut a la a, a hmet a, chhangpêr a siam a, a hmuh lai chuan a ur hmin ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A urna thlêng ata a la chhuak a, chhang chu a hmaah a hlui a; mahse, a ei duh lo va. Amnona chuan, “Mi dang zawng zawng hi heta ta chhuahtîr vek rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amnona chuan Tamari hnênah, “Ka mut pindanah hian chaw chu han la rawh le, i mi pêk ngei ka lo ei ang e,” a ti a. Tamari chuan a chhang siam chu a la a, a nuṭa Amnona chu a mut pindanah chuan a rawn pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ei tûr a pêk lai tak chuan Amnona chuan a lo man a, a hnênah, “Ka farnu, lo mu ve teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Ni lo ve, ka nuṭapa, mi tilui suh, hetiang thil hi Israel-te zîngah tih tûr a ni lo, he thil sual tak hi ti lul suh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka tân mualphona tâwp a ni a, ka meng ngam dâwn em ni? Nang pawh Israel-te zînga mi sual tâwpa ngaih i ni dâwn asin. Khawngaih takin lal hnênah sawi zâwk la, kan inneih a hnial lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, a thu sawi chu a ngaithla duh lo va, a aiin a chak si a, a mutpui lui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amnona chuan ngei tak têin a ngei leh ta si a, a hnênah, “Tho la, chhuak vat rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tamari chuan a hnênah, “Chuti mai tûr chu a ni lo vang; min hnawh chhuah hi ka chunga i tih tâk ai mah khân a sual zâwk a ni,” a ti a. Nimahsela, a ngaithla duh chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tirhkah chhiahhlawh chu a ko va, a hnênah, “He hmeichhia hi heta ta hi hnawt chhuak la, kawng hi kalh tlat rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh chuan ani chu a hnawt chhuak a, kawng chu a kalh ta a. Tamari chuan kawrfual ze hrang hranga ṭial mawi a ha a, chutiang kawrfual chu lal fanu thianghlimten an ha ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tamari chuan a lu-ah vaivut a phul a, kawrfual ze mawi tak a hâk lai chu a pawtthlêr a, a chhîpah a kut a suih a, ring taka ṭap chungin a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nuṭa Absaloma chuan, a hnênah, “I nuṭa Amnona chuan a khawih che a ni maw? Ka farnu, ngawi hrâm hrâm rawh, i nuṭa a ni alâwm. I rilru tina duh suh,” a ti a. Tichuan, Tamari chu a nuṭa Absaloma inah khawhar takin a inkhung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chûng thu chu Davidan a lo hriatin a thin a ur hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Absaloma chuan Amnona chu biak pawh a be ṭha duh ta lo va, a farnu Tamari a tihmualpho avângin Amnona chu a haw ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kum hnih a ral hnu chuan Efraim khaw kianga Baal-hazar-ah Absaloma chuan berâm hmul a mêt a, Absaloma chuan lal fapa zawng zawng chutah chuan a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Absaloma chu lal hnênah a kal a, a hnênah, “Ngai teh, i chhiahhlawhin berâm hmul ka mêt a, lal leh a ṭhuihruaite chu i chhiahhlawh hnênah hian kal ve teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lal chuan Absaloma hnênah, “Ni lo ve, ka fapa, kan za chuan kal lo ve, kan tihautak lutuk dah ang che,” a ti a. Absaloma chuan a sâwm lui a; mahse, a kal duh chuang lo va, mal a sâwmsak ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Absaloma chuan, “A nih loh leh ka unaupa Amnona tal ka hnênah kal ve rawh se,” a ti a. Lal chuan a hnênah, “Engah nge a kal bîk ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, Absaloma chuan a ngên luih tlat avângin Amnona leh lal fapa dang zawng zawng chu a kaltîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Absaloma chuan a chhiahhlawhte hnênah, “Amnonan uain a ruih thatho lai takin, ‘Amnona that rawh u’ ka ti ang a; tichuan, in that dâwn nia. Hlau rêng rêng suh u, hei hi in hnêna ka thupêk a ni, ngaihṭha takin awm ula, thlaphâng suh u” tiin a lo hrilh diam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Absaloma mite chuan an pu thupêk ang chuan Amnona chu an that ta a, lal fapa dang zawng zawng chu an sakawr chungah an zuangkai a, an tlânchhe ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kawng laka an la awm lai chuan, “Absaloman lal fapa zawng zawng chu pakhat mah zuah lovin a that vek mai,” tiin Davida chu an rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lal chu a tho va, a silhfênte a pawtthlêr a, leiah a mu a, a kianga a chhiahhlawh awm zawng zawng pawhin an silhfênte chu an pawtthlêr ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Davida u Sama fapa Jonadaba chuan, “Ka pu chuan lal fapa tlangvâl zawng zawng chu an thah vek ring suh se, Amnona chauh a ni thi ni. A farnu Tamari a tihhmingchhiat avâng hian hetianga tih hi Absaloma chuan a tum rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka pu, Lalpa chu lal fapa zawng zawng an thi emaw tiin lungngai duh suh se, Amnona chauh a ni thi ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Absaloma erawh chu a tlân bo ta a. Râlvêngtu tlangvâl chu a han hawi vêl a, a hnung lam tlângah chuan mi tam tak lo kal a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jonadaba chuan, lal hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh, lal fapate chu an lo hâwng a, i chhiahhlawhin a sawi ang chiah kha a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chu thu a sawi zawh chuan lal fate chu an lo thleng a, an ṭap hawm hawm a, lal leh a chhiahhlawhte pawh chu lungchhe takin an ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Absaloma chu a tlân bo va, Gesur lal Amihuda fapa Talmaia hnênah a kal a. Lal chuan Amnona chu rei tak a sûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Absaloma chu a tlân bo va, Gesur ramah a kal a, chutah chuan kum thum a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lalin Amnona a ngaih chu a reh ta a, Absaloma erawh chu a ngai êm êm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zeruii fapa Joaba chuan Absaloma chu lalin a ngai hle tih a hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joaba chuan Tekoa khuaa hmeichhe fel tak pakhat a kohtîr a. Hmeichhe hnênah chuan, “Lusûn angin awm la, lusûn thuam inbel bawk la, hriak pawh thih suh. Rei tak lusûn tawh angin awm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lal hnênah va kal la, hetiangin thu va sawi ang che,” a ti a, sawi tûr nên lam a hrilh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tekoa khua hmeichhia chu lal hnênah a kal ta a, bawkkhupin chibai a bûk a, a hnênah, “Aw lalber, mi pui rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Engtizia nge ni ta?” a ti a. Ani chuan “Hmeithai rethei tak ka ni a, ka pasalin min thihsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I bawihnu hian fapa pahnih ka nei a, lovah an insual a; tu mah ṭhelhtu an awm si lo va, pakhat zâwk chuan a unaupa chu a that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thi-a chhûngte zawng zawng chuan i bawihnu hi min do rawn a, ‘A unaupa thattu kha, a unaupa a thah phuba laa kan thah ve theih nân min pe rawh; roluahtu nei lovin kan han siam teh ang,” an ti a. Chutianga ka innghahna awm chhun an thah leh zêl chuan ka pasal thlah a mang ang a, leiah hian a hming a dai mai dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal chuan hmeichhe hnênah, “Va hâwng ta la, i chungthu chu ka tihfelsak mai ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tekoa khaw hmeichhia chuan lal hnênah, “Aw lalber, ka pu, eng pawh ti la, a mawh chu kei leh ka pa chhûngten kan phur ang, lal leh a ram chuan phur suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Mi tu pawhin an vau che chuan ka hnênah han hruai la, an tibuai leh tawh lo vang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan, “Phuba lâk tumtuten ka fapa dam chhun hi an thaha, chhiatna nasa lehzual an thlentîr loh nân lal chuan, Lalpa , i Pathian min ngensak rawh,” a ti a. Lal chuan, “ Lalpa mi nung hmingin ka tiam a che, i fapa chu engtin mah an tina lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan, “Khawngaih takin i bawihnu hian, ka pu, lal hnênah thu kam khat chauh ka sawi leh thei ang em?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Sawi ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan, “Engtizia nge Pathian mite chunga hetiang thil dik lo hi i tih? Lal chuan a fapa tlân bo chu a hruai hâwn leh duh loh chuan tûna a ṭawngka chhuak ngei khân thiam loh a chantîr a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan la thi ṭheuh dâwn, leia tuisik bua, ruh leh theih loh ang hi kan ni. Pathian pawhin mitthi tawh chu a nuntîr leh lo. Lal erawh hi chuan a hnên ata ram hla taka tlân bo chu hruai hâwn zai rêl teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw lalber, ka pu, miten min vau avângin he thu hi i hnênah ka rawn sawi ngam a ni. I bawihnu hian, ‘Lal hnênah ka thlen ang a, ka dîl hi min lo tihsak mahna,’ ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal chuan kei i bawihnu leh ka fapa hi Pathianin min pêk ram aṭanga min tihboral tumtute laka min chhanhim ka beisei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalber, ka pu, ka ngên a che, i bawihnu hi min thlamuan la, lalber ka pu chu Pathian tirhkohte anga engkim hre vektu i ni si a, Lalpa , i Pathian chu i hnênah awm zêl rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal chuan hmeichhe hnênah, “Ka zawh apiang eng mah zêp lovin min chhâng teh aw,” a ti a. Hmeichhia chuan, “Ka pu lalber chuan sawi ang hmiang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Hêng hi Joaba tihtîr che em ni?” a ti a. Hmeichhia chuan, “ Lalpa ka pu, i hmaah ka puang e, i thu zawh chu dik taka chhân loh theih a ni lo. Ni e, i chhiahhlawh Joaba chuan i bawihnu hi hêng thu zawng zawng hrilh tûr chein min tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh Joaba chuan thil siam ṭhat a tum a ni. Ka pu chu Pathian tirhkohte angin a fing a, ram chhûng thil thleng tinrêng a hre vek si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, lalin Joaba hnênah, “I remruat chu a ṭha e; kal la, tlangvâl Absaloma chu va hruai hâwng rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joaba chuan bawkkhupin zah takin chibai a bûk a, lal chu a fak a. Joaban, “Lal chuan a chhiahhlawh ngenna a hlawhtlintîr avângin i chhiahhlawh hian lalber, ka pu mit ka tlung tih vawiinah hian ka hre ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joaba chu Gesur-ah a kal a, Absaloma chu Jerusalem-ah a rawn hruai hâwng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lal chuan, “A in lamah kal sela, ka hmêl rawn hmu suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel-te zîngah Absaloma anga hmêlṭha chungchuang an awm lo va, a ke phah aṭanga a chhîp thlengin sawisêl tûr rêng a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A sam a ṭha êm êm a, a sei a, a buk lutuk châng apiangin a mêt ṭhîn a. A sam rih zâwng chu kg. hnih lai a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Absaloma chuan fapa pathum leh fanu pakhat a nei a, a fanu hming chu Tamari a ni a, a hmêl pawh ṭha tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Absaloma chu kum hnih lai lal hmêl hmu lovin Jerusalem-ah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lal hnêna tirh atân Absaloma chuan Joaba chu a chah a; mahse, a lo kal duh lo va. A chah nawn leh pawhin a lo kal duh chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A tâwpah a chhiahhlawhte hnênah, “Ka lo kiang kha Joaba lo a ni a, barli a chîng a, kal ula, va hâl rawh u,” a ti a. Absaloma chhiahhlawhte chuan lo chu an va hâl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Joaba chu Absaloma inah a kal a, a hnênah, “Engtizia nge i chhiahhlawhten ka lo an hâl mai le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Absaloma chuan Joaba chu a chhâng a, “Ka hnêna lo kala, lal hnênah, “Eng atân nge Gesur ata ka lo hâwn? Chutah chuan awm reng ila, ka tân a ṭha zâwk tûr,’ tia sawi tûrin ka chah che a ni lâwm ni? Tûnah, lal hnênah min hruai la, thil ka tisual a nih chuan min that mai rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tichuan, Joaba chu lal hnênah a kal a, chûng thu chu a hrilh a. Lal chuan Absaloma chu a ko va, ani chu a lo kal a, bawkkhupin lal chu chibai a bûk a. Lal chuan Absaloma chu a lo fâwp a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hnuin Absaloma chuan amah vêng tûrin tawlailîr te, sakawr te, mi sawmnga lai nên a buatsaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Absaloma chu zîng takah a tho va, kulh kawngka bulah chuan a lo ding ṭhîn a, lal hnêna thubuai sawi tûr neite chu Absaloma chuan a lo ko va, “Khawii khua nge i nih le?” a lo ti ṭhîn a. Anni chuan, “I chhiahhlawh hi Israel hnam zînga mi ka ni,” an ti zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Absaloma chuan, “I thu hi a dik khawp mai; mahse, lo ngaihtuahsak tûr che tu mah lal chuan a ruat si lo a nih hi,” a lo ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Absaloma vek chuan, “Rorêltu chu han ni ve ila chuan thubuai nei te, beisei neite chu dik takin ka lo rêlsak tûr,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah chibai bûk tuma rawn pantute chu a vuan a, a kuah a, a lo fâwp ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mi, lal hnêna thubuai sawi tûra lo kal apiangte hnênah Absaloma chuan chutiang chuan a lo ti zêl a. Tichuan, Israel miten Absaloma chu an ngaina ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kum li a vei hnuin Absaloman lal hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa hnêna ka thutiam hlen tûrin Hebron-ah min kaltîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hi Suria ram Gesura ka awm lai khân, ‘ Lalpa chuan Jerusalem-a min hruai kîr leh chuan Hebron khuaah Lalpa chibai ka bûk ang,’ tiin ka lo tiam tawh si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Thlamuang takin kal ta che,” a ti a. Hebron-ah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Absaloma chuan Israel hnam tin hnênah a rûkin mi a tîr a, “Tawtawrâwt ri in hriat veleh, ‘Absaloma chu Hebron-ah a lal ta’ ti ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, mi zahnihin Absaloma chu Jerusalem aṭangin an zui a. Chûng mite chu a sâwm chhuah an ni, thil awmzia eng mah an hriat loh avângin rilru thianghlim takin an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Absaloman inthawina a hlan lai chuan Gilo mi, Ahitofela, Davida rorêlpui chu, a awmna khua Gilo aṭangin a chah a. Lal an phiarna chu a nasa tawlh tawlh a, Absaloma lamṭang chu an pung tual tual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi pakhat hian Davida hnênah, “Israel-te chu Absaloma lamah an ṭang ta,” tiin a rawn sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Davida chuan a ṭhuihruai Jerusalem-a awmte hnênah, “Hawh u, i tlânchhia ang, tu mah Absaloma lakah kan him lo vang. I chhuak thuai ang u; chutilo zawng, min rawn nangchîng ang a, khua hi khandaihin a rawn bei ang a, min that dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal ṭhuihruaite chuan, “I chhiahhlawhte hi kan pu lalin a sawi apiang ti tûrin kan inpeih e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal chu a chhuak a, a laina zawng zawngin an zui a, a hmei sâwm erawh chu lal in nghâk tûrin a hnutchhiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lal chu a chhuak a, a mite chuan an zui vek a, khaw hmâwr in bulah chuan an innghâkkhâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh Keret mi te, Pelet mi te, Git mi te leh mi zaruk, Gath aṭanga amah rawn zuitute nên lal chu an bêl a, an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal chuan Git mi Itaia hnênah, “Engtizia nge kan zîngah i lo kal ve? Kîr la, lal thar hnênah chuan awm rawh. Nang zawng, ram dang mi, i ram ata râltlân mai i ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimin lawkah i lo kal a, engah nge vawiinah ka vahvaihpui ang che? Ka thangna tûr chin pawh ka hre lo. Chuvângin, kîr la, i mite kha hruai ang che. Lalpa chuan khawngaih che uin vêng zêl che u rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Itaia chuan lal chu a chhâng a, “ Lalpa nunna leh ka pu lal nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, khawiah pawh ka pu lal awmna tawh phawtah chuan thih leh thih, dam leh dam, i chhiahhlawh hi a awm ve zêl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Davida chuan Itaia hnênah, “Chuti chu i kal zêl ang u,” a ti a. Tichuan, Git mi Itaia chu a hote leh an chhûngte nên chuan an kal ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An kal ta chu a ram ṭahin an ṭap a, Lal chuan Kidron lui a kân a, a mite chuan an zui a, thlalêr lam panin an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zadoka leh Levia chite chuan Pathian Bâwm zâwnin an zui ve a, mipuiin khua an chhuahsan vek hma chu Bâwm chu an nghat a. Abiathara chu maichâmah a chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lal chuan Zadoka hnênah, “Pathian Thuthlung Bâwm chu khawpuiah kîrpui leh rawh u, Lalpa mit ka tlun chuan min hruai hâwng leh ang a, Pathian Thuthlung Bâwm chu a hmun ngaiah ka hmu leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“I chungah ka lâwm lo a ni,” a tih chuan ṭha a tih ang angin min ti mai rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal chuan puithiam Zadoka hnênah, “Zâwlnei i ni alâwm, in fate pahnih, i fapa Ahimaaza leh Abiathara fapa, Jonathana te nên thlamuang takin khawpuiah haw leh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kei chu, chanchin min rawn hrilh hma chu thlalêra lui kaiah kan lo awm ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zadoka leh Abiathara chuan Pathian Thuthlung Bâwm chu Jerusalem-ah an kîrpui a, chutah chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Davida chu ṭap chungin oliv tlângah a chho va, a lu a khuh a, ke lâwngin a kal a. A hnêna awm zawng zawng pawhin an lu an khuh a, ṭap chungin an chho ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Davida hnênah chuan, “Ahitofela chu phiarrutute Absaloma hote zîngah chuan a tel ve ta,” tiin an hrilh a. Davida chu, “Aw Lalpa , Ahitofela thurâwn chu engmahlovah chantîr ang che,” tiin a ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Davida chuan miten pathian an biakna ṭhin hmunsâng chu a han thlen chuan Ark mi Husaia chuan thawmhnaw thlêr phung inbelin, lu-a vaivut kai luam chungin a lo hmuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Davida chuan a hnênah, “Ka hnêna i kal ve chuan ka tân phurrit mai i ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khawpuiah kîr leh zâwk la. Absaloma hnênah, ‘Aw Lalpa , i chhiahhlawhah ka awm ang e; tûnhma khân i pa chhiahhlawh ka ni ṭhîn a; mahse, tûnah i chhiahhlawhah ka awm tawh ang e,’ ti la; tichuan, Ahitofela remruat chu i hnial ṭhîn ang a, min ṭanpui thei zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Puithiam Zadoka leh Abiathara pawh chutah chuan i kiangah an awm ang a, lal ina thil thleng i hriat apiang anni chu hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />An fate pahnih, Zadoka fapa Ahimaaza leh Abiathara fapa Jonathana pawh chutah chuan an awm kha. I thil hriat apiang mi rawn hrilh tûrin anni chu rawn tîr ṭhîn ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Absaloman Jerusalem khua a luh ni chuan Davida ṭhian Husaia pawh chu a lo thleng ve a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida chuan tlângchhîp a pêl chauh tihin Mefiboseta chhiahhlawh Ziba chuan a lo hmuak a. Ani chuan sabengtung pahnih, thuam bel sa, chhang tlang zahnih, grep pho ro bâwr za, theirah bâwr za leh uain peng khat nên a rawn keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal chuan Ziba hnênah, “Eng atân nge hêng hi i rawn ken duh le?” a ti a. Ziba chuan “Sabengtung hi lal chhûngkuate chuan nân ka ti a, chhang leh thei hi chu tlangvâlte ei atân a ni, uain erawh hi chu thlalêra chau apiang in atân a ni e,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Khawiah nge i pu fapa chu?” a ti a. Ziba chuan lal hnênah chuan, “Jerusalem-ah a awm. ‘Vawiin hian Israel-te chuan ka pa ram chu min pe leh dâwn,’ a ti nghe nghe asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal chuan Ziba hnênah, “Mefiboseta thil zawng zawng chu i ta a ni e,” a ti a. Ziba chuan, “Ka pu, i chhiahhlawh tlâwm tak ka ni e, i mittlunga awm zêl ka tum ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal Davidan Bahurim a lo thlen chuan Saula laichînte zînga mi, a hming Simeia, Gera fapa chu a lo chhuak a, kal pahin ânchhia a rawn lawh bawrh bawrh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Davida chu a sipaiten a ding lam leh vei lamah an vêng na a, Simeia chuan Davida leh a ṭhuihruaite chu lungin a rawn vawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Simeia chuan heti hian ânchhia a lawh a, “Kal bo daih rawh, kal bo daih rawh, tual thah chîng leh mi sualpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saula ram chu i chhuhsak vei a, a chhûngte chunga thisen i chhuah man Lalpa chuan a thungrûl ta che a nih hi. Lalpa chuan ram chu i fapa Absaloma hnênah a hlân ta. Thisen chhuah i chîn chu i chhiat phah ta a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zeruii fapa Abisaia chuan lal hnênah, “He uicho hian engtizia nge, Lalpa ka pu hi ânchhia a lawh? Khawi nge, a lu ka va lâksak teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal chuan, “E! Zeruii fate u, ka chungchângah lo inrawlh ve suh u. Lalpa chuan, ‘Davida ânchhia lawh rawh’ a hnêna a tih chuan ânchhia chu min lawh mai rawh se. ‘Engati nge hetianga i tih le,’ ti thei tu nge awm?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Davida chuan Abisaia leh a chhiahhlawhte hnênah chuan, “Ka fapa, ka rîla rah ngei pawhin mi thah a tum si chuan he Benjamin mi phei hi chuan a tum lehzual âwm rêng alâwm. Eng mah tih suh u, ânchhia chu min lawh mai rawh se, Lalpa tihtîr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka lungngaihna min hriatpui ang a, vawiina ânchhia min lawh hi malsâwmnaah a chantîr mai thei asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Davida leh a mite chu kawngah chuan an kal zêl a, ral lehlam tlâng aṭangin Simeia chuan kal chungin ânchhia a lawh reng a, lungin a vawm a, vaivutte a rawn theh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lal leh a mite chuan Jordan lui an lo thleng a, an chau hle a; chutah chuan an châwl hahdam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Absaloma chu a hnêna Israel awm zawng zawng nên Jerusalem-ah an lo lût a. Ahitofela pawh an zîngah a tel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ark mi, Husaia, Davida ṭhian chu Absaloma hnênah a lo kal a, a hnênah, “Lal chu dam reng rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Absaloma chuan Husaia hnênah, “I ṭhian i hmangaih dân chu hetiang hi a ni maw? Engtizia nge i ṭhian hnêna i kal loh?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Husaia chuan Absaloma hnênah, “Ka kal lo vang, Lalpa leh hêng mipuite leh Israel mi zawng zawngin an thlana lamah ka ṭang ang a, a hnênah ka awm zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu dang rawng nge ka bâwl ang? A fapa rawng chu ka bâwl dâwn lâwm ni? I pa rawng ka bâwl ang bawkin i rawng pawh ka bâwl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Absaloma chuan Ahitofela hnênah, “Rem mi han ruatpui teh, eng nge ka tih ang le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahitofela chuan, “I pa hmei, lal in nghâka a dahte chu mutpui la; tichuan, Israel mi zawng zawngin i pa pawi lian tak i khawih tih an hria ang a; nangmah zuitute chuan an ṭan sauh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, Absaloma tân lal in chungah puan in an zâr a, Israel mi zawng zawng mit hmuhin Absaloma chu a pa hmei mutpui tûrin a lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Ahitofela thurâwn chu mite chuan Pathian thu chhuak ang maiin an ngaisâng a, Davida leh Absaloma ngei pawh chuan Ahitofela thurâwn zawng zawng chu an pawisa ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahitofela chuan Absaloma hnênah, “Mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih ka thlang chhuak ang a, zâninah Davida ka va ûm teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A chauh chhiat lai tak ka va nangchîng ang a, ka ṭhâwng thut ang a, a mite zawng zawngin an tlânchhiatsan ang a, amah chu ka va that mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, mite chu, mo, a pasal hnêna a lawi angin i hnênah ka rawn hruai kîr vek ang. Thah i tum mi pakhat bâk chu an him vek ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu thurâwn chu Absaloma leh Israel upaho chuan ṭha an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Absaloma chuan, “Ark mi Husaia han ko ula, eng nge sawi tûr a neih i lo ngaithla ve phawt teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Husaia chu a lo kal a, Absaloma chuan a hnênah, “Ahitofela chuan hetiangin thu min râwn a, a sawi ang hian kan ti ang em? Ṭha i tih loh chuan i ngaih dân han sawi ve teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Husaia chuan Absaloma hnênah, “Tûn ṭuma Ahitofela remruat hi a ṭha lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I pa mite chu i hria a, râl beih thiam, savawm a notê an lâksak ang maia kawlhsen an ni a. Chu bâkah, i pa hi râl rêl thiam a ni a, a sipaite zîngah a riak kher lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûnah pawh pûkah emaw, hmun dangah emaw a biru daih ang. In inbei chauh tiha i mite an thih hlauh phei chuan a hria apiangin, ‘Absaloma sipaite an that chiam mai,’ an ti ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sipai huaisen, sakeibaknei rilru pute pawh hlauvin an khûr ang a, Israel mi zawng zawngin i pa indo thiamzia, a hotute huaisenzia te an hre vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hetiangin ti zâwk teh: Israel mi, Dan leh Beer-seba inkâra awm zawng zawng chu tuifinriat ṭiauvut zât ngawt ko khâwm la, nangmah ngeiin indonaah chuan hma hruai la;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tichuan, kan hmuhna apiangah kan bei ang a, leia dai tla ang maiin ani chu kan bei tluar tluar ang a; a hote nên pakhat mah kan zuah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuaa a tlân luh chuan Israel mi zawng zawng hruizên nên kan thawk ang a, a khaw chawpin kawrah kan hnuk thla mai ang, lungtê pakhat pawh kan zuah lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Absaloma leh Israel mite chuan “Ark mi Husaia remruat chu Ahitofela remruat aiin a ṭha zâwk,” an ti a. Absaloma chhiatna tûrin Ahitofela remruat ṭha tak chu Lalpa chuan dâl a lo tum rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Husaia chuan puithiam Zadoka leh Abiathara hnênah chuan Ahitofelan Absaloma leh Israel upate rem a ruatpui dân te, amah pawhin rem a ruatpui dânte a hrilh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Zâninah thlalêr lui kaia riak tawh lovin lui chu kân ngei rawh se. Chutilo zawng, lal leh a hote chu an rawn man vek mai ang’ tiin Davida chu hrilh thuai rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jonathana leh Ahimaaza chu Jerusalem daifêm, En-Rogel-ah an awm a. Bawihnu pakhat hian anni chu thu thar a va hrilh ṭhîn a, annin Davida an hrilh chhâwng leh ṭhîn a ni. Khawpuia an lût chu tu man an hmu tûr a ni si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naupang pakhat hian a lo hmu hlauh va, Absaloma a hrilh a; tichuan, anni pahnih chu an tlân bo ta thuai a, Bahurim-a mi pakhat inah an tlân lût a. Ani chuan a tualah tuichhunchhuah a nei a, a chhûngah chuan an lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In neitupa nupui chuan a chhinnain tuichhunchhuah chu a chhîn a, a chungah buh a pho va; tu man an hmu lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Absaloma chhiahhlawhte chu hmeichhe hnênah chuan an va kal a, a hnênah, “Ahimaaza leh Jonathana te kha khawiah nge an awm?” an ti a. Hmeichhia chuan, “Lui râl an kai daih tawh ang,” a ti a. Mite chuan an va zawng a; mahse an hmu lo va, Jerusalem-ah an kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chûng mite kal liam hnu chuan anni chu tuichhunchhuah ata chu an lo chhuak a, lal Davida chu an hrilh ta a, a hnênah, “Tho la, lui hi kân thuai rawh u, Ahitofela chuan in chhiatna a zawng rêng si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Davida leh a hote chu an chhuak a, Jordan lui chu varṭianah an kai vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahitofelan a remruat an zâwm lo tih a hriatin a sabengtung a thuam a, a khaw lamah a hâwng ta daih a. A chhûngkaw awm dân tûr a rel fel a, a inâwkhlum ta a. A ruang chu a pa thlânah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Absaloma leh a hnêna Israel awm zawng zawngin Jordan lui an kai lai chuan Davida chuan Mahanaim a thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Absaloma chuan Joaba aiah Amasa chu sipai hotu-ah a dah a. Amasa chu Ismael mi Jethera fapa a ni a, Nahasa fanu Abigaili hrin a ni, Abigaili chu Joaba nu Zeruii laizâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel mite leh Absaloma chuan Gilead ramah ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Davida chuan Mahanaim khua a thlen chuan Amon mi, Raba khuaa Nahasa fapa Sobia te, Lo-debar khua aṭanga Amiela fapa Makira te, Rogelim aṭanga Gilead mi Barzilaia te chuan puanthuah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />thleng te, eirêlna bungbêl te an rawn ken a, huit te, barli te, chhangphut te, vaikan te, bê te, thlaihnah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />khawizu te, bâwnghnute dak te, berâm te, bâwnghnute um te, Davida leh a mite ei atân an rawn ken a, “Mite chu thlalêrah rilṭâm leh tuihâlin an chau hle tawh,” tih an lo hre si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida chuan a hotute chu a ko khâwm a, sâng chunga hotu te, za chunga hotute a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Davida chuan sipai chu pâwl thumin a tîr chhuak a. Pâwl khat chu Joaban a ho va, pâwl khat chu Joaba u, Zeruii fapa Abisaian a ho va, pâwl thumna chu Git mi Itaian a ho va. Lal chuan sipaiho hnênah, “Kei pawh in hnênah ka kal ve dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mite chuan, “Kal lo ve; keiniho hi chu tlânchhia pawh ni ila min ngaimawh vak lo vang. A zâtve lai va thi pawh ni ila pawi an ti tehchiam lo vang. Nang erawh zawng keiniho sîng tlukin i hlu si a, khua aṭanga min lo ṭanpui hi a ṭha zâwk e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Ṭha in tih ang chuan ka awm ang e,” a ti a. Lal chu kulh kawngka bulah a ding a; sipaite chu za rual te, sâng rual tein an chhuak ta nguah nguah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal chuan Joaba te, Abisaia te, Itaia te hnênah, “Keimah avângin tlangvâl Absaloma chu va tina suh u aw,” tiin thu a pe a. Mi tinin Absaloma chungchânga lalin sipai hotute thu a pêk lai chu an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sipaite chu Israel-te bei tûrin indona hmun panin an chhuak ta a, an inbeihna hmun chu Efraim ngawpuiah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Davida mite chuan Israel sipaite chu an hneh a, chumi ni chuan mi sînghnih zet an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu lai ram kil tinah chuan an inbei a, khandaiha thah ai mahin ram ngawa tluhlum an tam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Absaloma chuan Davida mite a va tâwk ta thut a. Absaloma chu sabengtung chungah a chuang a, sabengtung chu sasaw thing hnuaiah a tlân lût a, Absaloma lu chu thingzârah a tâng a, a chuanna sabengtung chu a tlân zêl si a, thingzârah chuan a inkhai ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi pakhat hian Joaba hnênah, “Absaloma sasaw thing zâra a inkhai reng ka hmu,” tiin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joaba chuan a rawn hrilhtu hnênah, “I hmu maw? Engati nge i tihhlum nghâl mai loh? That la chu tangka sâwm leh kâwnghrên ka pe tûr che a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Tangka sâng pawh mi pe dâwn mah la, lal fapa chu ka that chuang lo vang, ka hriat lai ngeiin lalin i hnênah te, Abisaia hnênah te, Itaia hnênahte, ‘Tlangvâl Absaloma chu tu man khawih suh ang che u!’ a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal thu zâwm lovin lo that pawh ni ila, lalin a hre leh tho vang a; nang lah chu i inthiarfihlîm leh daih âwm si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Joaba chuan, “Chutiang mai mai, ka nghâk khawtlai hman lo che,” a ti a; fei pathum a la a, sasaw thingzâra Absaloma dama la inkhai reng chu a thinhnûnah a chhun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Joaba râlthuam kengtu sâwmin an rawn hual a, an chhun hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joaba chuan tawtawrâwt a hâm a, sipaiten Israel-te an ûm chu an bânsan a, a ko kîr ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Absaloma ruang chu an la thla a, ngaw chhûnga khuarkhurum thûk takah an paih a, a chungah lung an vawm khâwm thûr a. Israel mi zawng zawng chu mahni in lamah an tlân hâwng ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Absaloma khân “Lal Ruam” an tihah a dam lai khân dam lai lung a phun a, “Ka hming daih loh nân, fapa pawh ka nei si lo va,” a ti a ni. Chu lung dawh pawh chu a hming chawiin “Absaloma Hriatrêngna Lung” an ti a, tûn thlengin hmingah a la pu ta reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zadoka fapa Ahimaaza chuan, “Ka va tlân ang a, Lalpa chuan a hmêlma laka lal phuba a lâksak dân ka va hrilh teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joaba chuan, “Vawiin chuan chanchin thar chu va hrilh suh. Ni dangah i la hrilh dâwn nia. Lal fapa chu a thi si a, vawiinah zawng va hrilh rêng rêng suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joaba chuan Kus mi hnênah, “Kal la, lal chu i thil hmuh va hrilh rawh,” a ti a. Kus mi chuan Joaba chu kûnin chibai a bûk a, a tlân ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zadoka fapa Ahimaaza chuan Joaba hnênah, “Eng pawh ni se, Kus mi hnungah ka va tlân ve ang e,” a ti leh a. Joaba chuan, “Ka fapa, engah nge i tlân ve kher ang? Chanchin hrilh man i dawng dâwn si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Eng pawh ni rawh se, ka tlân rêng rêng dâwn,” a ti a. Joaba chuan “Tlân ta che,” a ti a. Ahimaaza chu phaizâwl lam kawngah a tlân a, Kus mi chu a lehpêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Davida chu kulh kawngka chhûng zâwk leh pâwn zâwk inkârah a lo ṭhu a. Râlvêngtu chu kulh kawngka pâwn zâwk chung lamah chuan a lâwn chho va, a han hawi vêl a, mi pakhat lo tlân hi a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Râlvêngtu chu a au va, lal chu a hrilh a, lal chuan “Pakhat mai a nih chuan thu ṭha rawn thlen tûr a ni ang,” a ti a. Mi chu a lo hnai telh telh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Râlvêngtu chuan mi dang lo tlân a hmu leh a, kawngkhâr vêngtu chu a au va, “En teh, mi pakhat a lo tlân leh e,” a ti a. Lal chuan, “Ani pawh thu ṭha rawn thlen tûr a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Râlvêngtu chuan, “A hmasa zâwk tlân dân chu Zadoka fapa Ahimaaza tlân dân a ang mang e,” a ti a. Lal chuan, “Ani zawng mi ṭha a ni a, thu ṭha a rawn thlen ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahimaaza chuan lal chu a au va, “A ṭha e,” a ti a. Bawkkhupin chibai a bûk a, a hnênah, “Ka pu, lal laka helho, i kuta petu Lalpa , i Pathian chu fakin awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Tlangvâl Absaloma chu a him alâwm maw?” a ti a. Ahimaaza chuan, “I chhiahhlawh hi Joaban min tirh chhuah laiin an buai mur mur ka hmu a; mahse, eng vang nge tih chu ka hre lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Lo kal hnai teh,” a ti a. A bulah chuan a va ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kus mi chu a lo thleng ve a, lal hnênah chuan, “Ka pu, lal tân chanchin lâwmawm ka rawn thlen e; Lalpa chuan i laka helho zawng zawng phuba chu a lâksak ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lal chuan Kus mi hnênah chuan, “Tlangvâl Absaloma chu a dam alâwm maw?” a ti a. Kus mi chuan, “Ka pu, lal hmêlmate leh thah tumtu che chu, he tlangvâl ang hian awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lal chu a mangang ta hle a, kulh kawngka chunga pindanah a chho va, a ṭap a, kal chungin, “Aw ka fapa Absalom, ka fapa, ka fapa Absalom, i aiah han thi zâwk ila aw, Absalom, ka fapa, ka fapa,” tiin a ṭap a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joaba hnênah, “Lalin Absaloma a sûn a, a ṭap a ṭap mai” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chu mi nia an hnehna chu sipai zawng zawng tân lungngaihna a ni ta zâwk a. Lal chu a fapa ngaiin a ṭap a ṭap mai tih an hre vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan mite chu indonaa sipai tlânchhia ang maiin zak takin khuaah an lût nghiai nghiai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal chuan a hmai a hup a, “Aw ka fapa Absalom, aw Absalom, ka fapa,” tiin a ṭap hawm hawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Joaba chu lal awmna inah chuan a lût a, a hnênah, “Vawiinah hian nang leh i fanu leh i fapate, i nupui leh i hmei te nunna chhanhimtute chu i tizak hle mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang mah hawtute chu i hmangaih a, nangmah hmangaihtute i hua a, i hote leh sipaiho chu engmahlovah min ngai tih vawiinah hian i tilang chiang hle mai. Absaloma chu dam sela, keini zawng zawng hi thi vek zâwk ila, chu chu i duh dân niin ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tûnah kal chhuak la, i mite fuih harh rawh, Lalpa chhâlin ka hrilh a che, i va chhuah loh zawngin naktûk zîngah chuan tu mah i hnênah an awm tawh lo vang. Chu chu i tleirâwl lai ata vawiin thlenga i chunga chhiatna lo thleng tawh zawng zawng ai daiha pawi thui zâwk a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal chu a ṭhu chhuak ta a, kulh kawngka bulah chuan a ṭhu a, “Lal chu kulh kawngka bulah a ṭhu e,” tiin mite chu an va hrilh a. Chu chu an hriatin a mite chu an lo pung khâwm ta a. Israel-te erawh chu mahni puan in ṭheuhvah an tlân hâwng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel zawng zawng chuan, “Davida chuan kan hmêlmate lak ata min chhan chhuak a, amah ngeiin Filistia mite lak ata min humhim a; tûnah Absaloma râl hlauvin ram hi a chhuahsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan rorêltu atâna hriak kan thih Absaloma lah chu a thi ta si a. Engtizia nge lal chu hruai hâwn leh zai kan rêl loh?” an ti a, an inhnial mur mur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lal Davida chuan Zadoka leh Abiathara hnênah mi a tîr a, “Juda upate hnênah heti hian va sawi rawh u, ‘Lal a in lama hruai hâwn thu-ah engtizia nge a muang bera in ṭan le? Israel miten lal hruai hâwn an rawt thu chuan lal beng a thleng tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka unaute u, ka thisen zawmpui in ni a, lal hruai hâwn thu-ah a zawiawi bera ṭang tûr em in nih?’ ti ula;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amasa hnênah pawh, ‘Ka thisen zawmpui i ni lo vem ni? Tûn aṭangin ka sipai hotu atân Joaba aiah ka dah loh che chuan Pathianin a tih tihin mi ti sela, na tak pawhin min sawisa mai rawh se, a ti e,’ va ti rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Davida chuan Juda mi zawng zawng rilru chu aikhatah a luantîr ta dual a, lal hnênah chuan, “I mite zawng zawng nên lo haw leh rawh u,” tia hrilh tûrin mi an tîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal chu a lo hâwng a, Jordan lui thlengin a lo kal a, Jordan luia hruai kai tûrin Juda mite chu Gilgal an lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gera fapa Simeia, Benjamin hnam, Bahurim khuaa mi chu lal Davida hmuak tûrin Juda mite rualin hmanhmawh takin a lo chhuak ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A rual chuan Benjamin mi sângkhat leh Saula chhûngkaw enkawltu Ziba te, a fapa sâwm leh panga leh a chhiahhlawh sawmhnih lai lal thlen hmain Jordan an lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal chhûngkuate hruai tûr leh ṭûl a tih a piang ti tûrin lui chu an kal kai a. Gera fapa Simeian Jordan lui a kai veleh lal hmaah a bawkkhup a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal hnênah chuan, “Ka pu, khawngaih takin min ngaidam rawh; ka pu, Jerusalem i chhuahsan nia i chhiahhlawhin i chunga ka tihsual chu min theihnghilhsak tûrin ka ngên a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kei, i chhiahhlawh hian thil ka tisual tih ka hria; mahse, vawiinah ka pu lal lo hmuak tûrin Josefa chhûngte zînga he hmun rawn thleng hmasa ber hi ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zeruii fapa Abisaia chuan, “ Lalpa hriakthih ânchhia a lawh avângin Simeia hi tihhlum tûr a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Zeruii fate u, min rêlpui tûr eng nge awm? Min hnial min hnial mai a. Vawiinah, Israel mi rêng rêng, tu mah tihhlum tûr a ni lo; kei hi Israel-te lal ka ni lo vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lal chuan Simeia hnênah, “I thi lo vang,” tiin a tiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saula tupa Mefiboseta chu lal hmuak tûrin a lo chhuak a. Lalin Jerusalem a chhuahsan aṭanga dam taka a lo hâwn leh thlengin ani chuan a kete a sil lo va, a khabehmul a mêt lo va, a puante a su hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lal hmuak tûrin Jerusalem aṭang chuan a lo kal a, lal chuan a hnênah, “Mefiboset, engati nge ka hnênah i lo kal ve loh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ani chuan, “ Lalpa , ka pu, ka chhiahhlawhin min bum atin a ni, a hnênah, ‘lal hnêna ka kalna tûr sabengtung buatsaih rawh,’ ka ti a, kei lah hi ka ke a zeng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chuan, ka pu lal hnênah chuan min hêk a; mahse, Lalpa , ka pu chu Pathian vântirhkohte ang a ni a, ṭha i tih ang angin ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka pa chhûngte zawng zawng chu, Lalpa , ka pu chuan tihlum vek âwm rêng a ni; mahse, i chhiahhlawh hi i chaw kîlpuiah min siam a. Chuvângin, lal hnênah hian eng dang han dîl ngam tûr ka ni em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lal chuan a hnênah, “In chungchâng thu hi engah nge i sawi leh ṭhin? Nang leh Ziba chuan Saula ram chu insem rawh u ka tih tawh kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mefiboseta chuan lal hnênah, “Ziba chuan ram chu nei vek rawh se, ka pu lal chu ama in ngeiah râlmuang takin a lo thleng tawh si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gilead mi Barzilaia chu Rogelim aṭangin Jordan luia lal hruai kai tûrin lal rualin a lo chhuk ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Barzilaia chu upa tak, kum sawmriat mi lai a ni a. Mi awm thei tak a nih avângin Mahanaim-a lal Davida a chawlh chhûng zawng zawng khân ei tûr a tumsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lal chuan Barzilaia hnênah, “Jerusalem-ah lo kal ve la, ka bulah awm ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Barzilaia chuan lal hnênah, “Ka dam rei tawh awm si lo va, eng vângin nge Jerusalem-ah lal hnêna ka han chhoh ve kher ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kum sawmriat lai ka ni tawh a, eng mah hi ka tâna nuam a awm tak tak tawh lo va, i chhiahhlawh hian a tui leh tui lo pawh ka hre tawh lo va, nula tlangvâl zai ri lah ka hre thei tawh si lo. Engah nge i chhiahhlawh hian, ka pu lal ka tihhautak ang che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hian, lal hi, Jordan lui kaipui che ka tum mai a ni. Engah nge lal chuan chutianga lâwmman min pêk i tum le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Khawngaih takin i chhiahhlawh hi min hâwntîr mai la, ka nu leh pa thlân bul, kan khuaah ka thi ang e. Amaherawhchu, hei, i chhiahhlawh, ka fapa Chimhama hi hruai la; ka pu lalin ṭha i tih angin i chhawr atân awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Lal chuan a chhâng a, “Chimhama chuan min zui sela, ṭha i tih apiang ka tihsak ang a, eng pawh i dîl apiang ka lo pe zêl ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mi zawng zawngin Jordan lui an kal kai a, lal pawhin a kai ve a; lal chuan Barzilaia chu a fâwp a, mal a sâwmsak a; tichuan, a in lamah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Lal chuan Gilgal a lo thleng a, Chimhama pawh a hruai a, Juda mi zawng zawng leh Israel hnam zâtve laiin lal chu an vêng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Israel mi zawng chuan lal hnênah, “Engati nge kan unau Juda-te hian nang leh i chhûngte chu i hote nên Jordan lui a rûka an lo hruai kai bîk mai che le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Juda mi zawng zawng chuan, “Lal hi kan lamhnai a nih avâng chauhva hruai kai kan ni a; engtiziaa thinur mai nge in nih le? Lal neih kan eiin lâwmman kan dawng a ni bîk hlei nêm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Israel-te chuan Juda-te chu an chhâng a, “Davida lala siam thu-ah in lamhnai ni mah se, a lêt sâwmin thu kan nei asin. Lala hruai kîr leh rawt hmasatu kan nih kha hre ta rêng che u,” an ti a. Mahse, Juda mite thu chu Israel mite thu ai chuan a rum ta zâwk mah a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gilgal-ah chuan Benjamin hnam, Bikria fapa Seba, mi sual tak a lo awm kher a. Ani chuan tawtawrâwt a hâm a, “Davida hnênah chan kan nei lo va, Jesaia fapa hnênah eng mah chan tûr kan nei lo. Aw Israel mite u, inah haw vek rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel mi zawng zawngin Davida zui duh lovin Seba chu an zui ta a. Juda mite erawh chuan Jordan aṭangin Jerusalem thlengin an lal chu rinawm takin an zui tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Davida chuan Jerusalem-a lal in chu a lo thleng a, a in nghâka a dah, a hmei sâwmte chu a hruai a, a vêng tlat a, a châwm a; mahse, an hnênah a lût lo. An damchhûngin a khung tlat a, hmeithai angin an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal chuan Amasa hnênah, “Ni thum chhûngin Juda mite hi ko khâwm la; tah chuan, nang pawh lo awm ve ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amasa chu Juda mi ko khâwm tûrin a chhuak a; mahse, hun ruat aiin a va thang rei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Davida chuan Abisaia hnênah, “Bikria fapa Seba hian Absaloma ai mahin min tibuai dâwn alâwm le; i pu vêngtute hruai la, ûm rawh u; chutilo zawng, kulh nei khuaahte a lût ang a, kan hmuh phâk lovah a chhuak hlauh dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Joaba hote, Keret mi te, Pelet mi te leh an mi chak zawng zawng te chuan Abisaia chu an zui a, Jerusalem aṭang chuan Bikria fapa Seba ûm tûr chuan an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gibeon lungpui lian an va thleng a, Amasa chuan a lo hmuak a. Joaba chuan indo thuam a inbel a, a kâwnghrênah khandaih, a pâi chawpin a pai a. A kal zâwng chuan khandaih chu a dawk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joaba chuan Amasa hnênah, “Unaupa, i dam zêl alâwm maw?” a ti a. Joaba chuan Amasa chu fawh tum awm takin a khabehmul a kut ding lamin a chelhsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amasa chuan Joaban khandaih a keng tih a hre lo va, Joaba chuan a pumah a vit a, a rîlte a tla ta nuai a, vih nawn ngai lovin Amasa chu a thi ta a. Joaba leh a unaupa Abisaia chuan Bikria fapa Seba chu an ûm zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joaba mite zînga pakhat Amasa ruang bulah chuan a ding a, “Tu pawh Joaba leh Davida lama ṭang apiangin Joaba zui rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amasa ruang chu kawng laiah a awm a, thi-in a bual nasa hle mai a, lo kal apiang chuan an en a, an ding zêl a; chu mi chuan mi zawng zawngin an dinchilh zêl tih a hmuhin Amasa ruang chu kawng ata phûlah a hnûk thla a, puanin a khuh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kawng ata a lâk sawn hnu chuan Bikria fapa Seba ûm tûrin mi zawng zawng chuan Joaba chu an zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Seba chuan Israel hnam tin ram chu a fang chhuak a, Abel-beth-maaka khua a lo thleng a, Bikri mite chu an pung khâwm a, ani chu an pui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Joaba mite chu an lo thleng a, Abel-beth-maaka chu an rawn hual a, kulh bang pâwnah chuan lei an chhûng pâwng a, a kulh bang tihchim tumin an chhu bur bur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmeichhe fing tak hi kulh aṭang chuan a rawn au va, “Khaih, Joaba kha lo kal hnai sela, thu ka lo hrilh ang e, tih han hrilh teh u khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, hmeichhe hnênah chuan a va kal hnai a, hmeichhia chuan a hnênah, “Joaba i ni em?” a lo ti a. Ani chuan, “Ni e,” a ti a. Hmeichhia chuan a hnênah, “I bawihnu thu sawi hi ngaithla teh,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Ka ngaithla e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hmânlai chuan ‘Abel’ khuaah thurâwn va dawng rawh,’ an ti ṭhîn a, chutiang chuan thu an titlu ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keini hi Israel zînga inremna duhtu leh rinawm taka awm ṭhîn kan ni a; mahse, nang chuan Israel ram khaw hlun, Lalpa pual chu tihchhiat i tum a nih hi le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joaba chuan, “Chutiang a ni awzâwng lo, tihchhiat leh nuai bo ka tum hlei nêm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutiang lam a ni lo. Amaherawhchu, Efraim tlângram mi, Bikria fapa Seba kha lal Davida lakah a hel a, ani chu min pe ula, khua chu ka tawlh kîrsan ang e,” a ti a. Hmeichhia chuan Joaba hnênah, “Aw le, a lu chu kulh bang pâwnah ka rawn vawm chhuak ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan fing takin mipui chu a va hmin a, Bikria fapa Seba lu chu an tansak a, Joaba hnênah an rawn theh chhuak ta a. Tin, Joaba chuan tawtawrâwt a hâm a, khawpui chu an ṭînsan ta a. Mite chu mahni in lamah an haw ṭheuh va, Joaba pawh lal hnênah Jerusalem-ah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joaba chu Israel sipai zawng zawng hotu a ni a; Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu Keret mite leh Pelet mite hotu a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Adorama chu kuli hotu a ni a, Ahiluda fapa Jehosafata chu chanchin la khâwmtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Seva chu ziaktu a ni a, Zadoka leh Abiathara te chu puithiam an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jair mi Ira pawh chu Davida puithiam a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida lal laiin kum thum a zâwnin ṭâm nasa tak a tla a. Davida chuan Lalpa a râwn a. Lalpa chuan, “Saula leh a chhûngten thisen an chhuah vâng a ni e, Gibeon mite a that a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gibeon mite chu Israel thlah an ni lo va. Amor mi la dam chhunte thlah an ni, Israela thlahte chuan zuah an lo tiam tawh a; mahse, Saulan Israel-te leh Juda-te tâna ṭhahnem a ngaih êm avângin tihchimih a tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Davida chuan Gibeon mite hnênah, “Eng nge ka tihsak ang che u, in chunga Saula thil sual tih man ka rûl ang che u; tichuan, Lalpa mite hi mal in sâwmsak dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gibeon mite chuan a hnênah, “Saula leh a chhûngte nêna kan inkâr thu hi tangka leh rangkachaka tihfel mai chi a ni nêm. Keinin Israel-te tihhlum a thiang si lo va,” an ti a. Ani chuan, “In duh apiang ka tihsak ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anni chuan lal hnênah, “Israel ram puma kan boral chimih vekna tûr ruahmantu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saula fapa pasarih min pe la, Lalpa mi ruat Saula khua Gibea-ah Lalpa hmaah kan khai hlum ang e,” an ti a. Lal chuan, “Ka pe ang che u,” a ti a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal chuan Saula fa, Jonathana fapa Mefiboseta chu Saula fapa Jonathana nên Lalpa hmaa thu an lo tiam tawh avângin a hum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal chuan Aii fanu Rizpii laka Saula fapa pahnih Armonia leh Mefiboseta erawh chu a hruai a; Meholat mi Barzilaia fapa Adriela leh Saula fanu Mikali fapa panga nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gibeon mite hnênah a hlân a; tichuan, tlângah Lalpa hmaah chuan an khai hlum a. An pasarih chuan an thi ta a. An thah hun chu buhseng ṭan tirh, barli seng ṭan tirh lai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aii fanu Rizpii chuan saiip puan a la a, Lungpui hmun, mitthi ruang awmnaah chuan a zâr a, chutah chuan buhseng tirh aṭangin ruahtui tlâk thlengin a awm a. Chhûnah chunglêng sava lo kalte chu a vêng a, zânah ramsate a vêng bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saula hmei, Rizpii, Aii fanu thiltih chu Davida chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Davida chu a chhuak a, Saula ruh leh a fapa Jonathana ruh chu Jabes Gilead mite hnên ata a la a. (Chûng mite chuan Filistia miten Gilboa tlânga Saula an thah ni khân Beth-san muala an khai chu an ru a ni)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />chuta ṭang chuan Saula leh Jonathana ruhte chu an la a, an khaihlumte ruh nên chuan an chhar khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Saula ruh te, Jonathana ruhte nên Benjamin rama Zela khuaa a pa Kisa thlânah an phûm ta a. Lalin thu a pêk ang chuan an ti ta a. Chumi hnu chuan ram tâna an dîlna chu Pathianin a chhâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Filistia mite leh Israel mite chu an indo leh a. Davida leh a hote chu an chhuk a, Filistia mite chu an bei a, Davida pawh a chau hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Milian fate zînga mi Isbibenoba chu dâr fei kg. thum leh a chanvea rit leh khandaih thar pai chuan Davida thah a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahse, Zeruii fapa Abisaian a lo chhan a, Filistia mi chu a bei a, a that ta a. Davida mite chuan a hnênah, “Israel-te khâwnvâr a mih loh nân indo tûrin kan zîngah i chhuk ve tawh hauh lo vang,” tiin chhia an chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Filistia mite nên indona Gob khuaah a awm leh a. Husa mi Sibekaia chuan milian fate zînga mi Safa a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Filistia mite nên Gob khuaah bawk an indo leh a. Bethlehem mi Jaira fapa Elhana chuan Git mi Goliatha chu a that a, a fei ngul chu kechâwn tiat lai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gath khuaah indona a awm leh a, chutah chuan milian tak, kutzungṭang leh kezungṭang paruk ve ve nei, a vaia sawmhnih leh pali nei a awm a, ani pawh chu milian thlah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel mite chu a cho va. Davida u Simeia fapa Jonathana chuan a lo that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chûng mi palite chu Gath khuaa milian thlah an ni a, Davida leh a mite chuan anni chu an that a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida chuan Lalpan a hmêlmate kut ata leh Saula kut ata a chhan chhuah ni chuan Lalpa fak nân he hla hi a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Lalpa chu ka lungpui leh ka kulhbîng, Min chhandamtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka Pathian chu min humhimtu, ka hahchawlhna a ni, Ka phaw leh ka himna ber, ka kulhbîng sâng, Ka tlûkluhna tûr a ni. Min beitu laka chhantu chu i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Fak tlâk Lalpa chu ka ko vang a, Ka hmêlmate lakah ka him ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thihna tuifâwnte chuan min chîm a, Chhiatna tuifâwnte chuan min khuh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Seol hrualhruite chuan mi phuar a, Thihna chuan thangin min hual vêl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangang takin Lalpa chu ka au va, Ka Pathian chu ka ko va, Ani chuan a Tempul aṭangin ka aw a lo hria a, Ka au thâwm chu a lo ngaithla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thinur avângin lei hi a nghîng a, A che hlawk hlawk a, Vân innghahna chu a nghîng a, a khûr dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hnâr aṭangin meikhu a lo chhuak ngut ngut a, A kâ aṭanga lo chhuak mei chu a alh hluah hluah a, A ṭêk chuai chuai mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chuan vânte chu a tihawng a, a lo chhuk a, A ke hnuaiah thim chhah mup a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cherub chunga chuangin a thlâwk a, Thli chuan a thlawhpui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thim chhah mupin a hual vêl a, Chhûm chhah tak ruah pai chhûm chuan a hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hmaa êng awmah chuan, Meilingte chu a alh hluah hluah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan vânah khawpui a tiri dur dur a, Chungnungbera chu a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hmêlmate chu thalin a kâp a, ṭêk a dentîr a, a ûm darh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hau va, A hnâra thawin a chhêm vak a, Tuipui mawngte leh leilung nghahchhante chu A lang zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chung lam aṭangin mi rawn ban a, mi chelh a, Tui thûk tak ata min hnûk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka hneh loh, ka hmêlma hlauhawm tak tak, Mi hawtute laka ta chu mi chhan chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anni chuan ka mangan laiin min bei a, Lalpa chuan mi hum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chuan hmun râlmuangah min dah a, Ka chunga a lâwm avângin mi chhanhim ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chuan dik taka ka tih avângin mal min sâwm a, Pawi ka khawih loh avângin mi zuah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa kawngte chu ka zawh a, Ka Pathian chu ka sual bosan ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Awm dân tûra a tih zawng zawng ka pawisa a, A thuruatte chu ka zâwm lo ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A hmaah chuan sawisêlbovin ka awm a, Sual lakah ka invêng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa chuan dik taka ka tih avângin mal min sâwm a, Pawi ka khawih lo, A hmu reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi ngilneite chungah ngil i nei a, Sawisêlbote lakah sawisêlbo i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi thianghlimte tân i thianghlim a, Mi luhlulte lakah i luhlul a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mi tlâwmte chu i chhan a, Mi chapote chu i titlâwm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nang hi ka êng i ni a, Lalpa chuan ka nun thimte a tiêng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A ni, râl bei tûrin min tichak a, Ka Pathian ṭanpuinain an kulh bangte ka ṭhiat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian hi zawng a dik famkim a, Lalpa thute chu innghahna tlâk a ni. Amah pantute tân ani chu phaw a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lalpa lo chu tu nge Pathian dang awm, Kan Pathian lo chu tu nge lungpui dang awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />He Pathian hi ka tlûkluhna kulh nghet, Ka kawng tihimtu chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka kete chu zukpui anga chakin a siam a, Tlâng sângah te him takin mi awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka kutte hi râl do a zirtîr a, Ka bânte hian dâr thalngul a kuai zo ta hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Min hmu a, i phawin min khuh ta; Min ṭanpui avângin ka ropui ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka ke pên i tisau va, Min man phâk ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka hmêlmate ka ûm a, ka hneh a, Ka tihboral vek hma chu ka kîrsan lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka thehthlu a, ka thehthal rum a, An tho leh tawh ngai lo, Ka rapbet ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Indo tûrin min tichak a, Ka hmêlmate chu min tihtlâwmsak ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ka hmêlmate ka ûm a, Min hawtute chu ka tiboral ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />An hawi vêl a; mahse, chhantu an nei si lo, Lalpa an au va; mahse, a chhâng duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Leia vaivut angin ka vaw dip a, Kawtthlêra chirh angin ka rap pherh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nangin ka laka helhote kut ata min chhan chhuak a, Israel-te hotu atân mi humhim a, Ka hriat ngai lohte pawh ka khualehtui an lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ram dang mite chuan min rawn tlawn a, Ka sawi apiang an awih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hnam dangte chu an zâm a, An kulhbîng ata khûr chungin an lo chhuak ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Lalpa mi nung, ka lungpui chu fakin awm rawh se, Ka inhumhimna lungpui, Pathian chu chawimawiin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ani chu phuba mi lâksaktu Pathian a ni, Hnamte chu ka ke hnuaiah a dah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ka hmêlmate lak ata min chhan chhuak a, A ni, mi dotute chungah mi dah ta, Mi nunrâwngte lakah chuan min chhan ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw Lalpa , hnam tin zîngah ka fak ang chia, I hming fakin ka zai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A lal thlan chu ropui takin a hnehtîr a, A hriakthih Davida chungah leh a thlahte chungah, Kumkhuain a ngilneihzia a lantîr ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hei hi Davida thu sawi hnuhnûng ber chu a ni, Jesaia fapa Davida thu sawi chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sâng taka Pathian chawisân, Jakoba thlah Pathian hriakthih, Israel tâna hla mawi tak tak phuahtu thute chu. “ Lalpa thlarau chuan ka hnênah thu a sawi a, A thute chu ka kâah a dah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian, an lungpui chuan ka hnênah thu a sawi: ‘Mite chunga dik taka rorêla, Pathian ṭih chunga ro rêl ṭhîntu hnênah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu mi chu khaw thiang ni chhuak mawi tak ang hi a ni, Ruahsûr bân khaw thianga thlai lo harh sêrh ang hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu chu Pathianin kan chhûngkua min din dân a ni lâwm ni? Kumkhua atân ka hnênah thu a thlung a, Tihdanglam leh tawh loh tûr chu. Min chhandamin duhthusâm min pe lo vang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi suaksualte erawh chu hlîng anga paih bo an ni ang, Kut lâwnga khawih ngam an ni si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawihtu tûr chuan thîr leh feingul hmang sela, Hâl ral vek tûr an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hêng hi Davida sipai huaisente hming chu a ni: Takemon mi Joseb-basebeta chu ‘huaisen pathum’ zînga chhuanvâwr ber a ni, Ezni mi Adinoa tih a ni bawk. Ani chuan fei a lek a, an inbeihnaah ṭum khatan mi zariat a that a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A dawt chu Eleazara, Aho chi, Dodoa fapa a ni. Chumi chu Filistia mite indo tûra an pun khâwma Israel-te an tlân darh vek lai khân Davida nêna hmêlmate chotu, ‘sipai huaisen pathumte’ zînga mi kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thawk lawk a, Filistia mite a that chiam a, a kut kham lutuk avângin a khandaih pawh a thlah thei lo hial a ni. Chumi ni chuan Lalpan ropui takin a hnehtîr a, Israel sipaite chu râllâk sum chuh tûr ngawtin an lo kîr leh a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A dawt lehtu chu Sama, Harar mi, Agea fapa a ni. Filistia mite chu dailuah tamna hmun Lehi-ah an pung khâwm a, Israel-te chu hmêlma hmaah an tlânchhia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ani erawh chu a ṭanhmunah a ding tlat a, Filistia mite chu a that a, Lalpa chuan ropui takin a hnehtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Buhseng ṭan tirh laiin mi huaisen sawmthum zînga pathumte chu Davida awmna Adulam pûkah an chhuk a. Filistia sipai pâwl khat chuan Refaim-ho hmunah ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Davida chu kulhbîngah a awm a, Filistia sipaiho erawh chu Bethlehem-ah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Aw, Bethlehem kulh kawngkhâr kianga tuichhunchhuah tui kha tuin emaw min va chawisak se ka va ti em!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sipai huaisen pathumte chuan Filistia-ho riahhmun chu an tâwn tlang a, kulh kawngkhâr kianga tui chu an va chawi a, Davida hnênah an rawn la a. Nimahsela, ani chuan a lo in duh ta lo va. Lalpa tân a bun chhuak ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Heti hian a ti a, “Aw Lalpa , hei hi ka in loh tûrzia mai chu. Thih huama kalte thisen chu ka in ang maw?” a ti a. Tichuan, a in duh ta lo va. Chûngte chu huaisen pathumte thiltih chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zeruii fa Joaba u Abisaia chu ‘mi huaisen sawmthum’ zînga hotu ber a ni a. Mi zathum a feiin a that a, ‘huaisen sawmthumte’ zîngah chuan hmingṭhat a hlawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi huaisen sawmthum zînga chhuanawm ber a ni a, chuvângin, an hotu-ah an siam a; mahse, mi huaisen pathum an tihte zîngah a tel pha lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jehoiada fapa Benaia, Kabzeel khaw mi pawh a huaisen hle, thil ropui tak a ti, Moab mi huaisen pahnih a that a. Tin, vûr tlâk laiin pûka tawm sakeibaknei a that bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aigupta mi, palian tak a that bawk. Aigupta mi chuan fei a keng a, Benaia chuan tiang nên a pan thla a, Aigupta mi fei chu a chhuhsak a, a fei ngei chuan a chhun hlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehoiada fapa Benaia chuan chutiang thil chu a tih avângin ‘Sipai huaisen sawmthum’ zînga chhiar tel a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Mi huaisen sawmthum’ zîngah chuan a hming a ṭha ber a; mahse, mihuaisen pathumte zîngah chuan a tel pha lo. Davida chuan amah vêngtu hotu-ah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Joaba nau Asahela chu mi huaisen sawmthum zînga mi a ni a. Bethlehem khuaa mi Dodoa fapa Elhanana te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Harod mi Sama te, Harod mi Elika te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pelet mi Heleza te, Tekoa mi Ikesa fapa Ira te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anathot mi Abiezera te, Husa mi Mebunaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aho mi Zalmona te, Netofa mi Maharaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Netofa mi Baana fapa Heleba te, Benjamina thlah Gibea khaw mi Ribaia fapa Itaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pirathon mi Benaia te, Gaas luitêa mi Hidaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Arabat mi Abi-Albon-a te, Bahurim mi Azmaveta te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Salbon mi Eliaba te, Jasena fapate zînga mi Jonathana te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Harar mi Sama te, Harar mi bawk Sarara fapa Ahiama te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Maaka mi Ahasbaia fapa Elifeleta te, Gilo mi Ahithofela fapa Eliama,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Karmel mi Hezroa te, Arba mi Paaraia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zoba mi Nathana fapa Igala te, Gad mi Bania te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amon mi Zeleka te, Joaba râlthuam kengtu Beerot mi Naharaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jatir mi Ira leh Gareba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hit mi Uria te an ni. An za chuan sawmthum leh pasarih an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel-te chungah chuan Lalpa chu a thin a ur ta a. Davida chu an chunga buaina thlen tûrin a chawk tho va, a hnênah, “Kal la, Israel-te leh Juda-te chhiar rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal chuan a sipai hotu Joaba hnênah, “I sipai hotute nên Israel mite awmna hmun tin, Dan aṭanga Beer-seba thlengin fang chhuak ula, mi eng zât nge an nih hre tûrin chhiar vek rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joaba chuan lal hnênah, “ Lalpa , i Pathian chuan i mite chu a lêt za aia tamin tipung sela, i mit ngeiin chu chu hmuhtîr che rawh se; amaherawhchu, eng atân nge chu chu ka pu lal hian hriat i duh kher le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Joaba leh a sipai hotute chuan lal thu chu an hnial ngam si lo va, Joaba leh sipai hotute chu Israel-te chhiar tûr chuan lal hnên ata chu an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jordan lui an kân a, Gad mite lui ruama Aroer khaw chhim lamah awmhmun an khuar a, hmâr lam panin Jazer-ah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gilead-ah te, Hit-ho ram Kades-ah te an kal a, Dan an pan a, khawthlang lama inherin Sidon an thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />chhim lam an pan a, Tura kulh an tlawh a, Hiv leh Kanan-ho khua an tlawh vek a, Judai ram chhim lam Beer-seba an thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ram an fan chhuah hnu, thla kua leh ni sawmhnih hnu chuan Jerusalem-ah an lo kîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joaba chuan mihring an chhiar chhuah zât chu lal a hrilh a, Israel ramah chuan khandaih keng mi, mi huaisen nuai riat an awm a, Juda mi chu nuai nga an awm tih a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chhiarpui an zawh hnu chuan Davida chu a inthiam lo ta hle a. Davida chuan Lalpa hnênah, “Thil ka lo tisual nasa hle mai; mahse, tûnah hian, Aw Lalpa , i chhiahhlawh khawlohna hi la bo tûrin ka ngên a che, thil âtthlâk takin ka lo ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zînga Davida a lo thawh chuan Lalpa thu chu Davida zâwlnei Gada hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Thil chi thum thlan tûr ka ruatsak a; kal la, a chunga ka tih tûr ber pakhat thlang tûrin Davida chu hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gada chu Davida hnênah a kal a, chûng thu chu a hrilh a, a hnênah, “A eng ber chu nge i thlan dâwn inngaihtuah rawh le: I rama kum thum chhûng ṭâm tuar nge, i hmêlmaten thla thum chhûng an ûm che nge, i rama ni thum chhûng hripui lêntîr? Mi tîrtu engtin nge ka chhân ang min hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Davida chuan Gada hnênah, “Thlan ngaihna ka va hre lo ve. Lalpa kutah tlulût phawt mai ila, a lainatna a nasa a, mihring kutah chuan min tlûkluhtîr lul suh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel-te chungah ni thum chhûng hripui a lêntîr ta a, Dan aṭanga Beer-seba thlengin mi sîngsarih an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vântirhkohvin tichhe tûra Jerusalem lama a kut a han lek chuan Lalpan chu thil ṭha lo tak tih a tum chu a sût a, mite tiboraltu Vântirhkoh hnênah chuan, “A tâwk tawh e, i kut lek tawh suh,” a ti a. Lalpa tirh Vântirhkoh chu Jebus mi Arauna hruih bulah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Davidan mite tiboraltu Vântirhkoh chu a hmuhin Lalpa hnênah, “Ngai teh, ka lo sual a ni, dik lo takin ka lo ti ta a; mahse, hêng berâmte hian eng nge an tihsual? Kei leh ka chhûngte hi min hrem zâwk tûrin ka ngên a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Gada chu Davida hnênah a lo kal a, a hnênah, “Chho la, Jebus mi Arauna hruihzâwlah Lalpa tân maichâm siam rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa thupêk, Gadan a hrilh ang chuan Davida chu a chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Arauna chu a han hawi a, lal leh a chhiahhlawhte a lam pana an lo kal chu a hmu a, Arauna chuan a pan a, bawkkhupin lal chu chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Arauna chuan, “Engtiziaa Lalpa , ka pu chu, a chhiahhlawh hnênah lo kal nge a nih le?” a ti a. Davida chuan, “Mipui zînga hri lêng a kian theih nân Lalpa maichâm siamna tûrin i hruihzâwl rawn lei ka tum a ni” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Arauna chuan Davida hnênah, “Ka pu, lal chuan ṭûl i tih chu hmang la, i duh apiang chu hlân rawh. Hei hâlral thilhlan atân bâwngpa te, thingtuah atân hruih hmanrua te leh bâwng nghâwngkawl te a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawng hi, aw lalber, ka pe vek a che,” a ti a. Arauna chuan lal hnênah, “ Lalpa i Pathian chuan i thilhlan chu lo pawm rawh se,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lal chuan Arauna hnênah, “Chutiang zawng ni lo ve, a leiin ka lei zâwk ang e; eng mah insêng lovin Lalpa ka Pathian hnênah hâlral thilhlan ka hlân tawp lo vang,” a ti a. Tichuan, Davida chuan hruihzâwl leh bâwngpate chu tangka tlang sawmngain a lei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Davida chuan chutah chuan Lalpa tân maichâm a siam a, hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlan a hlân a, Lalpa chuan ram tâna a dîlna chu a chhâng a, Israel rama hri lêng chu a reh ta a.
  </para>
</usx>
